data='{\ \"vtp\": [\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, will undertake the fulfillment of the providence.\",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"8\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"2,000 years ago, Heavenly Parent sent the Only Begotten Son Jesus, it was originally Heaven\'s Will to send the Only Begotten Daughter at the same time, to realize the ideal of True Parents. However, at the time, the central figures who were called upon to support Heaven\'s providence, including Jesus\' mother Mary, Zechariah and his family, and John the Baptist, were unable to fulfill their responsibilities and not only blocked the path of the Only Begotten Son Jesus, but also did not create the necessary foundation for the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"98\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Only Begotten Son Jesus exemplified the standard of absolute faith, absolute love, and absolute obedience toward Heavenly Parent. He attained individual perfection of the heart and, in complete oneness with Heavenly Parent\'s heart, loved all people and the world. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"42\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In accordance with the principles of the creation of one son and one daughter, an Only Begotten Son will not be born again after Jesus. Since Jesus himself suffered the death of his body and cannot come again in the flesh, for Christ to return a person must be selected who can take over that mission and walk the path of the True Parents that Jesus could not. That person is the Messiah at the Second Coming\ . \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"79\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent had to prepare for the possibility that the Only Begotten Daughter could not be sent together with the Only Begotten Son Jesus. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"26\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Preparing long in advance for the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter in case of such an eventuality, Heaven nurtured the Korean Han people as a separate chosen people through some 5,000 years of the 6,000- year providence of restoration. The Only Begotten Daughter was born on the foundation of the chosen Han people of Korea against the backdrop of Christianity.\",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"61\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The purpose of Heavenly Parent\'s providence during the 2,000 years after Jesus\' time was to bring about the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"26\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Only Begotten Daughter, born after 6,000 years of providential history, is the central pillar for the completion of the providence. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"22\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother proclaimed the founding year of Cheon Il Guk (Heavenly Kingdom) on February 22, 2013 (the 13th day of the 1st month by the heavenly calendar) and since 2014, she has been declaring that she is the Only Begotten Daughter.\",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"41\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Until now, Christians have respected and attended God as Heavenly Father, but by revealing and speaking about Heavenly Mother, True Mother desires that we can attend God not just as Heavenly Father, but as Heavenly Parent.\",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"35\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"To restore the standing of Heavenly Mother and Heavenly Parent, it was necessary for True Mother to proclaim herself the Only Begotten Daughter, no matter what sacrifices this might require her to make. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"40\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The essence of God is as our Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"16\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The essence of Jesus is to meet the Only Begotten Daughter and together become the True Parents. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The essence of Christianity is the preparation for the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter, the appearance of the Returning Messiah, and the Marriage Supper of the Lamb, which are implied in Jesus\' promise to return. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"38\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Through the Marriage Supper of the Lamb, the Only Begotten Daughter and the Returning Messiah become True Parents. True Parents are to give rebirth and resurrection to all humanity through the Marriage Blessing. They will complete Heaven\'s providence by establishing an era in which humanity can truly attend and live together with Heavenly Parent on earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"63\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Adam and Eve, who were created in the Garden of Eden\' as a man and a woman in the image of Heavenly Parent, and who were to become the first ancestors of humankind, fell as a result of disobeying the commandment not to eat the fruit of the tree of the knowledge of good and evil, and were expelled from the Garden of Eden. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"72\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After the flood judgment, Heavenly Parent carried out the providence of salvation to send both the Only Begotten Son and the Only Begotten Daughter at the same time among the descendants of Abraham, whom Heavenly Parent had selected and blessed within the lineage of Noah\'s son Shem. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"50\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In order for Heavenly Parent to send the Only Begotten Son and Only Begotten Daughter at the same time, the chosen people of Israel had to fulfill their responsibility to create a foundation to welcome both of them at the same time. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"45\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"On a foundation completed through 4,000 years of devoted effort, Heavenly Parent brought about the birth of Jesus, the Only Begotten Son, about whom God could finally say, \\\"This is my son!\\\" \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"33\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Throughout the 33 years of his life, Jesus eagerly awaited the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter. However, Heavenly Parent could not bring about the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter during Jesus\' time. This is because Mary, Zechariah, Elizabeth, the people of Israel and the faith leaders of that time were unable to create an environment in which the Only Begotten Daughter could be welcomed. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"68\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Understanding how people\'s fallen nature can lead them to act wrongly, Heavenly Parent began quietly preparing the Korean people 5,000 years ago so they would be ready in case the people of Israel were unable to fulfill their responsibility. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"41\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Jesus Christ died on the cross without being able to complete his mission on earth. However, unlike Adam, Jesus was able to complete the victorious foundation as the Only Begotten Son, reaching personal perfection of heart during his 33 years of earthly life. Therefore, since Jesus was the Only Begotten Son who had reached perfection, when Christ returns, it is not possible that another Only Begotten Son would be born to replace him. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"79\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heaven called Moon Sun-myung as the person who would inherit the mission of Jesus , giving him the heavenly mandate for that mission. Having inherited Jesus\' mission , before he could begin completing it as the Returning Messiah, he had a responsibility to fulfill. That responsibility was to discover the teachings that Jesus had been unable to proclaim, to declare those teachings, and to gather followers from within the Christian sphere to create a nationwide foundation. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"82\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Being born as the Only Begotten Son means that Jesus was born as a son in the direct lineage of Heavenly Parent, cut off from the sin-stained lineage of fallen humankind- . As a son in God\'s direct lineage, the Only Begotten Son could communicate and relate directly with Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"58\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother is the Only Begotten Daughter coming for the first time after 6,000 years as the unique daughter of Heavenly Parent who can fully receive God\'s first love. As a daughter in the direct lineage of Heaven, the Only Begotten Daughter is a unique daughter, the only one born from the root of Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"63\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Only Begotten Daughter cannot complete the ideal of True Parents alone. She must meet the one who has been called to the mission of the Returning Messiah, and through the Holy Wedding, advance to the position of the True Parents together with him. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"52\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The essence of the 2,000 years of Christian history, which began with the resurrection of Jesus and the descent of the Holy Spirit, is to prepare for the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter coming for the first time, while waiting for the Second Coming of the Messiah. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"54\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Only Begotten Daughter must be born on a Christian foundation that has come down through the chosen Han people of Korea so that the providence of the Messiah at the Second Coming can be fulfilled, and the Returning Messiah can advance to the position of True Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"55\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Today\'s Christianity still does not understand the essence of Jesus. Why did Jesus say he would come again? He wanted to return to complete his mission by meeting the Bride and advancing to the position of True Parents through the Marriage Supper of the Lamb. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"46\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Only Begotten Daughter, True Mother, was born into a family with three generations of only daughters and a strong Christian foundation. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"23\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Only Begotten Daughter was born in 1943, precisely 400 years after John Calvin, who contributed systematic thought to the Reformation, wrote his 1543 thesis The Necessity of Reforming the Church. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"32\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Only Begotten Daughter was born on the foundation of Korean Protestantism, which has its roots in American Protestantism, brought into being as a result of the Reformation. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The reason Jesus said he would come again is that the Only Begotten Daughter had not been born at that time. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"22\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Only Begotten Son and Only Begotten Daughter, like the original ancestors of humankind in the Garden of Eden were born able to converse directly with Heavenly Parent and know Heavenly Parent\'s Will and the principles of creation through their original nature. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"43\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"During the time the Only Begotten Daughter was growing up, she conversed with Heavenly Parent through resonance of heart, the language of the heavenly kingdom. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"27\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The place where True Parents, as perfected human beings, and Heavenly Parent become one is the central point of heaven and earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"23\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"How does the central point of heaven and earth appear? It appears when Heavenly Parent and True Parents become one and live together. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent\'s dream is to become one with True Parents and to live in oneness with all humanity as the sons and daughters in the kingdom of heaven on earth and in the eternal world. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"36\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Humanity\'s wish is also to become one with and live together with Heavenly Parent on earth. That place where Heavenly Parent\'s dream and humanity\'s hope are realized is the central point of heaven and earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"36\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The place where Adam and Eve become one as a perfected couple becomes the central point of goodness where God, the subject of love, and human beings, the objects of beauty, become one in body and complete the purpose of creation. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"43\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The central point of heaven and earth is the center of goodness where Heavenly Parent\'s purpose of creation has been completed. It is the place where Heavenly Parent is no longer alone and can experience joy through love eternally. It is the central point of truth where Heavenly Parent\'s Word is embodied and made flesh. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"56\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The center of heaven and earth is where the True Parents of Heaven, Earth and Humankind appear, and multiply children of Heaven without limit. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"25\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The central point of heaven and earth does not refer to a specific geographical location, but the place where Heavenly Parent and True Parents become one, and it begins from the Holy Wedding of True Parents. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"37\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents\' Holy Wedding was meant to be held on a national scale supported by Korean Christianity. However, the foundation that had actually been created by the time the Holy Wedding was held in 1960 was only conditional. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"40\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"If national restoration had been completed at any time following the 1960 Holy Wedding, the Holy Wedding would have been held again on the substantial level, and Heavenly Parent and True Parents could have become one and proclaimed Foundation Day at that time. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"44\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The 53-year period from 1960 to 2013 was a grueling marathon continuing on toward national restoration. True Mother refers to this period as a wilderness era. This wilderness era refers to the era from the Holy Wedding up to the time just before the establishment of Cheon Il Guk, so it is the period before the proclamation of Cheon Il Guk Foundation Day. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"64\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The 16th day of the 3rd month (by the lunar calendar) in 1960 should have been the day when Heavenly Parent became one with True Parents. However, as that could not be accomplished, from 1960, True Parents began a 53-year marathon, focused on the world. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"46\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In 2010, during the course of the marathon for national restoration that continued from 1960 to 2013, True Parents declared the perfection, consummation, and completion of the ultimate oneness of True Father and True Mother. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"36\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In 2011, True Parents declared the complete oneness of True God and True Parents. We have entered the era where True Parents are in Heavenly Parent and Heavenly Parent is in True Parents. On this foundation, in 2013 it was possible to proclaim Cheon Il Guk Foundation Day. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"49\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The era of the substantial Cheon Il Guk 天一国 (Heavenly Kingdom) began through the proclamation of Cheon II Guk Foundation Day in 22 Feb, 2013 (In Lunar calender, it was on the 1st month 13th day) . The internal Cheon Il Guk refers to the Heavenly Parent, and the external Cheon Il Guk refers to the True Parents. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"60\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother refers to this time when True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, is here on earth in the flesh and when Heavenly Parent can work directly with her, as the golden age. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"34\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The central pillars who can complete Heaven\'s providence are the son and daughter of Heavenly Parent\'s direct lineage who were born as the Only Begotten Son and Only Begotten Daughter and walked the path of the principles of Creation. Thus, it is True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, who was born as a daughter in the direct lineage of Heavenly Parent and walked the path according to the principles of creation, who is the central pillar for the completion of the providence. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"83\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When did True Mother become the central pillar for the completion of the providence? First, since the proclamation of the Foundation Day of Cheon Il Guk in 2013, the central pillar for the completion of the providence on earth has been the Only Begotten Daughter, True Mother, who is here in the flesh. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"55\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent\'s dream is being substantially fulfilled on earth through True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"17\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After Foundation Day, True Mother, who had resolved to complete the providence in her lifetime, travelled across the world to meet the standard of restoring seven nations, seven religious orders and one continent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"34\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In 2020 True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, proclaimed the firm settlement of Cheon Il Guk that had long been dreamed of, and established Heavenly Parent\'s Holy Community which can embrace all of humanity. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"35\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Only Begotten Daughter True Mother has been the central pillar for the completion of the providence since the Holy Wedding in 1960. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"25\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Only Begotten Daughter True Mother has been the central pillar for the completion of the providence since her birth in 1943. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"23\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In order for a person to stand as the central pillar for the completion of the providence in the stage where Heaven\'s providence is moving toward completion, that person must be born as the Only Begotten Son or Only Begotten Daughter and walk the path to perfection in accordance with the principles of creation. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"55\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"An Only Begotten Son or Only Begotten Daughter can directly communicate with God from childhood and feel and know the providence for themselves. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent\'s providence can only be completed when the person who is the central pillar responsible for Heaven\'s providence is alive on earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In Heavenly Parent\'s heart, the Only Begotten Daughter True Mother has been the central pillar for the completion of the providence since Jesus\' crucifixion. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"25\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, met and married the Messiah at the Second Coming, True Father, she made her own decision and was guided by Heavenly Parent to participate in the Holy Wedding. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"36\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"From the time of the Holy Wedding until Foundation Day, Heavenly Parent has worked to ensure that the Only Begotten Daughter, True Mother, would be able to maintain her position as the central pillar for the completion of the providence. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"41\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents and the blessed families are in a parent-child relationship connected to the lineage of Heaven. All blessed family members are sons and daughters whom True Parents love. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"31\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"All blessed families have the responsibility to complete their dutiful path of hyojeong (filial heart), uniting with True Mother by being one in heart, one in will, one in thought and one in action. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"35\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Spirit and truth are unique, eternal and unchanging. However, the degree and scope of their teaching and the means of their expression will vary from one age to another as they restore humankind from a state of utter ignorance. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"40\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"For modern, intellectual people to be enlightened in the truth, there must appear another textbook of higher and richer content, with a more scientific method of expression. We call this the new truth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"34\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"We should cultivate a humble heart and make the utmost effort to receive divine inspiration through prayer. We should not be strongly attached to conventional concepts, but rather should direct ourselves to be receptive to the spirit, in order that we may find the new truth which can guide us to the providence of the new age. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"58\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In the Cheon Il Guk era, Heavenly Parent and True Parents have become one as the True Parents of Heaven, Earth and Humankind, they cannot be separated. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"28\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Between the Holy Wedding in 1960 and 2013 the teachings proclaimed were those of the wilderness era, and the teachings proclaimed since Foundation Day, starting from 2013, are those of the Cheon Il Guk era based on the principles of creation. The way to properly understand the original essence of the teachings and the providence is to first study those of the Cheon Il Guk era. This means understanding the teachings of the wilderness era through those of the Cheon Il Guk era. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"85\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"It is our dutiful path as the sons and daughters to gratefully accept the new teachings True Mother is giving us, not based our own subjective standpoint but from the perspective of our True Mother and Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"39\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"While True Mother is on earth, Heavenly Parent and True Father are with True Mother, and True Mother is with us; so this is a golden time. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"28\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Now is the time of the completion of the providence, when the earth is being put in order with the cooperation of the absolutely good spirits. It is the time when True Father is mobilizing the entire spirit world to come to earth and advance the providence. When we become absolutely one with True Mother, True Father can mobilize the entire spirit world to come to earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"68\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"While True Mother is on earth, Heavenly Parent and True Father are with True Mother, and True Mother is with us; so this is a golden time. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"28\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"If we just become one in heart with True Mother, we will experience miracles and we will be able to do the work True Mother is doing. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"28\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"While True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, is on earth, Heavenly Parent can dwell on earth in the flesh through True Mother, speaking directly to the children and living with them. Heavenly Parent can also become one with True Mother and directly preside over the providence. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"47\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When we become absolutely one with True Mother, True Father can mobilize the entire spirit world to come to earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"21\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother learned from God about enduring and waiting . Starting from 1960, True Mother spent 53 years ENDURING and WAITING, unable to reveal the truth of the providence. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother\'s heart immediately after True Father\'s passing from this earthly life to the eternal world (Cheonju Seonghwa) was truly indescribable, a situation where she felt she had been left alone to complete the providence. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"37\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"It was Heavenly Parent\'s hope that True Father\'s Cheonju Seonghwa Ceremony would be held on a national foundation, with the leaders of all nations in attendance, but in the situation where this was not possible, True Mother had to take the reins of the providence by herself. True Mother had no one around her with whom she could consult about Heaven\'s providence. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"64\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The six months between True Father\'s Seonghwa and Foundation Day were a desperate time, like searching for a needle in the dark. It seemed as though True Mother was alone in a sandstorm blowing in a remote desert, unable to open her eyes as she searched for one small needle. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"51\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother did not have even one small needle with whom to discuss the providence. She is still looking for that one small needle. We must all become the small needles that True Mother is looking for. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"39\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother is the Only Begotten Daughter, born as Heavenly Parent\'s daughter, coming for the first time after 6,000 years. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"21\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, is in the position of the central pillar for completing Heaven\'s providence. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"19\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, is deeply regretful that although after the Holy Wedding in 1960, the first button should have been fastened correctly, it was not. The wilderness period that she spent with the truth of the providence weighing on her heart was a time of patience and waiting. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"53\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After enduring patiently for half a century, True Mother finally revealed the truth of the providence beginning with the declaration of the Only Begotten Daughter, thus fastening the first button properly. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"32\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Up until this present time, the Family Federation for World Peace and Unification has understood the providence of Heaven centered on the Only Begotten Son, Jesus, and the Messiah at the Second Coming. Now, it is time to study the Word and the providence from the perspective of the Only Begotten Daughter, True Mother \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"55\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The highest wisdom for living in the era of Cheon Il Guk is to understand the Word and the providence from the perspective that the Only Begotten Daughter, True Mother, is the central pillar for the completion of Heaven\'s providence. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"41\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter and Substantial Holy Spirit, presided over the Foundation Day (22 Feb, 2013) and made the historic founding proclamation. \\\"We must now change how we address God. When we pray, we will change ‘Hananim\' to ‘Haneul Bumonim.\' This is ‘Heavenly Parent.\' It is smooth in English and is also meaningful in Korean. Therefore, when you pray, the very first words you utter should be \'Heavenly Parent\' followed by \'Beloved True Parents of Heaven, Earth, and Humankind.\' Let\'s change this first. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"86\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"“By looking at the natural world and the human world, we see that the Creator God who governs the world is not just a male being. You must understand clearly that life came into being because of the existence of both Heavenly Father and Heavenly Mother.\\\" Considering these words of True Mother, we can understand that the era of Cheon II Guk after Foundation Day is the time when we must attend God as Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"77\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Eestablishing our view of God as Heavenly Parent is a prerequisite for us to live according to the spirit of the Cheon Il Guk era. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"28\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"To clearly grasp the attributes and character of the Heavenly Parent, we need, above all, to know God\'s heart, and to gain an in-depth understanding of the masculine and feminine characteristics of our Heavenly Parent who exists as our Father and Mother. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"43\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"There is nothing in the created world that has brought about its own existence. As all things of creation are resultant beings, if we trace the origin of their existence, we find that ultimately there must be a causal being. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"41\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"God, who gave birth to this world and humanity, exists not only as God the Father but also as God the Mother-that is, as Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"27\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The relationship between God and human beings is ultimately that of parent and child. Therefore, we refer to God as Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"23\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In the beginning, Heavenly Parent had a dream. That dream was to give birth to a son and a daughter resembling their Heavenly Parent, and when they had grown to maturity and become one in true love, to dwell within them and share their life on earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"48\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Our first ancestors, Adam and Eve, were to grow up to be like pure and clear water, deeply experiencing the heart of the Heavenly Parent, set a standard of absolute faith, absolute love and absolute obedience, and achieve their perfection by their own conscious effort and then follow the course of True Parents. However, they fell during their growing period, and the realization of Heavenly Parent\'s ideal was frustrated. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"70\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In order to find the sons and daughters lost due to the Fall, Heavenly Parent has been guiding the long and arduous history of the providence of restoration for more than 6,000 years. Even though nobody could see it, Heavenly Parent has silently and patiently endured, continuing along the path to restoring humankind. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"54\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"People must understand the sorrow and suffering of our Heavenly Parent which has permeated every juncture of the providential history of restoration and quickly return to Heavenly Parent\'s embrace. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent has original yang (masculine) and original yin (feminine) natures and are reflected in all created beings, including men and women. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"23\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent has a masculine personality (nam-seong gyeok-ui) with a masculine internal nature and external form, that is, the Heavenly Father. At the same time, Heavenly Parent also possesses a feminine personality (yeo-seong gyeok-ui) with feminine internal nature and external form, the Heavenly Mother. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"47\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The dual masculine and feminine natures of Heavenly Parent were expressed separately in the created world, through the creation of beings in a pair system, including man and woman, male and female, stamen and pistil and positive and negative. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"40\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The yang-yin relationship of Heavenly Parent is reflected within men as a masculine internal nature and external form, and within women as a feminine internal nature and external form. Stated more simply, men have a masculine mind and a masculine body, and women have a feminine mind and feminine body. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"52\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Men are the substantial objects of Heavenly Parent\'s masculine nature, and women are the substantial objects of Heavenly Parent\'s feminine nature. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"22\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"According to True Parents\' words, each man or woman is born resembling one of the two personalities of Heavenly Parent, with men resembling God\'s masculine personality or nature and women resembling God\'s feminine personality or nature. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"37\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Men are partial manifestations of Heavenly Parent, resembling the Heavenly Father\'s masculine nature, while women are partial manifestations of Heavenly Parent who take after the Heavenly Mother\'s feminine nature. Man and woman must therefore marry to reflect the image of God who embodies dual characteristics-the invisible male nature and the invisible female nature. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"54\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent exists on a foundation of deep heart (shimjeong) with the Heavenly Father personality and Heavenly Mother personality in complete unity, rather than existing as two independent entities. This is why, when translating the Korean Haneul Bumonim (Heavenly Parent) into English, the singular is used instead of the plural. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"51\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"There are always limits to human perception. Even so, the most direct route to understanding Heavenly Parent is through human beings, who most closely resemble Heavenly Parent. This resemblance comes about when a man and a woman, who are the manifestation of Heavenly Parent\'s masculinity and femininity, form a conjugal bond, have children, form a family, and become completely one in love. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"63\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When Heavenly Parent dwells at the center of the conjugal love of the first ancestors, the Only Begotten Son and Only Begotten Daughter, who have achieved perfection as individuals, and there is loving oneness between God and them, together they are called the True Parents of Heaven, Earth and Humankind. -\",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"53\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents have always emphasized that husbands and wives should view each other as representatives of God, and that as reciprocal partners, their very existence as a husband or wife depends on the existence of each other so they should live for each other\'s sake. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"46\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Husbands should attend their wives as they would Heavenly Mother, and wives should attend their husbands as they would Heavenly Father. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"22\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When we clearly understand the masculine and feminine personalities of Heavenly Parent according to the Principle, and experience substantially the position of Heavenly Father and the position of Heavenly Mother through the True Parents of Heaven, Earth and Humankind, we will come to understand clearly what it means to say that God is our Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"57\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In order to attend and serve their parents completely, children must understand their parents\' hearts. Likewise, in order for people, who were born as children of Heavenly Parent, to fully attend and serve Heavenly Parent, they must be able to resonate with Heavenly Parent\'s heart. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"46\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When the first human beings, a man and a woman, who were created in the image of Heavenly Parent, matured to reach perfection of heart through their own conscious effort, and then became a couple, Heavenly Parent wanted to be present at the center of their love, dwell within them, and become True Parents together with them. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"58\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"we can say that Heavenly Parent\'s dream is completing the ideal of True Parents. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"15\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent\'s ideal of True Parents originated from Heavenly Parent\'s shimjeong (heart). Shimjeong is an emotional impulse to love endlessly. It is the source of true love that cannot be suppressed, a love that longs to give and give to others, and then to forget that you have given. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"50\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The center of the concept of Creation was true parents who would realize Heavenly Parent\'s dream together. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"18\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The expansion of the universe began with the Big Bang, and Heavenly Parent\'s infinite heart also exploded in the earnest search for partners with whom to share love. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"29\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Those who realize the ideal of the True Parent together with Heavenly Parent are born as direct sons and daughters of Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"What kind of being most closely resembles Heavenly Parent? It is none other than Heavenly Parent\'s unique son and daughter, who resemble Heavenly Parent in heart and substance and have inherited true love, true life, and true lineage, that is, the Only Begotten Son and Only Begotten Daughter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"49\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"All things in heaven and earth grow and become perfected through three orderly stages: the formation stage, the growth stage, and the completion stage. Aside from human beings, the things of the creation grow to perfection naturally over time following the laws of nature. However, because human beings have not only a physical body but also a spirit body, they must experience the heart of Heavenly Parent during their period of growth, understand the principles of the creation, and practice those principles in order to reach perfection. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"88\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Human beings must have an attitude of absolute faith, absolute love, and absolute obedience toward Heavenly Parent, become pure men and women with pure bodies and minds, and grow to individual perfection, becoming one with Heavenly Parent through love. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"40\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When we say that True Parents fully resemble Heavenly Parent, it means that they become Heavenly Parent\'s body. Heavenly Parent is present within their love and their lives, giving birth to children together, becoming the True Parents, and forming a true family. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"43\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When True Parents unite completely with Heavenly Parent through love and give birth to children, those children grow up in the environment of a family, which is the place where Heavenly Parent\'s four major realms of heart and love can be experienced and they are the love of children, the love of siblings, conjugal love and parental love. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"59\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \" The family is like a school of love. In the family, people go through their lives from the stage of children to the stage of parents, they experience Heavenly Parent\'s love and their hearts come to resemble Heavenly Parent\'s heart. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"42\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In a family where Heavenly Parent is at the center, people experience and learn about the dynamics of horizontal relationships, such as those among siblings, and vertical relationships such as those between parents and children, and then can use that understanding to guide their relationships in society. In this way, based on their experience in their families, people multiply the realms of heart of children, siblings, and parents throughout the world, with the result that the world comes to be one global family attending Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"88\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The lives of the True Parents of Heaven, Earth, and Humankind, who have realized the ideal of true parents as the first ancestors of humankind, are the fundamental models that show how all people should live. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"37\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents are absolute, unique, unchanging, and eternal, and the descendants of True Parents can never replace True Parents, who are their roots. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Cheon Il Guk begins from the True Parents and is the nation where two people become one. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"18\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When the heart of True Parents resonates with the hearts of their children and all of humankind, we will see the three aspects of the human heart which are emotion, intellect, and will focusing on the same destination, that is, the purpose of creation. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"45\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The values of beauty, truth, and goodness pursued by emotion, intellect, and will are expressed in various aspects of human culture, such as the arts, science, philosophy, and ethics. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Cheon Il Guk is a nation and world that resembles the True Parents. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"14\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"For the past 2,000 years of Christian history, Heavenly Parent has suffered the pain of not being able to approach people as Heavenly Mother. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"25\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The genes that generate the life of a fetus are received equally from both the father and the mother. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"20\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"At the beginning of life, an unbreakable bond of blood is established between the mother and the child. It is through the mother and baby investing everything with all their might at the risk of their lives, that the amazing miracle of a new life occurs. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"47\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"During the life of a fetus in the womb, the mother forms a direct relationship of heart with the fetus and invests all that is needed for the development of the fetus\'s mind and body. She not only contributes to the growth of the body but also creates the basis for emotional qualities and personality. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"57\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother states, \\\"With regard to the birth of a child, the mother is 99.99 percent responsible.” This kind of effort from the mother is akin to that of Heavenly Mother, who gave birth to humanity in the beginning. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"40\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Historically, we have understood the Creator God as a masculine figure like an architect. But can we talk about giving birth to life without mentioning the mother? \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"28\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"People have lived without knowing about Heavenly Mother\'s labors at the time of creation. From now on, we must be able to experience the creation of humankind from the perspective of Heavenly Mother\'s hope, situation and heart. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"38\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"We must experience the sorrowful heart of Heavenly Parent, who was unable even to be recognized as a parent by the people of the world, who had descended to a state of ignorance after the Fall of the first human ancestors. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"42\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After Adam and Eve ended up falling, frustrating Heaven\'s hopes, the people of the world descended to the level of servant of servants, lower than the things of creation, in a state of extreme ignorance. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"36\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After the Fall, Heavenly Parent had no relationship with humankind, who were then in the position of servants, or servants of servants. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"23\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"For human beings, in the position of servants, their understanding of God was one of an omnipotent master. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"19\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Even the Israelites, God\'s chosen people, called God \\\"Yahweh\\\" (YHWH) or “Jehovah,” signifying \\\"the Almighty,” and were afraid to utter God\'s name directly. Instead, they used the honorific \\\"Adonai,” which, at the time, was how servants would address their masters. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"41\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent, unable to relate directly with the people of the Old Testament era, with a heart full of sorrow and frustration, had no choice but to lead the providence during the Old Testament era with the assistance of angels instead of people. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"44\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After the Fall, it took 4,000 long years before Jesus, the Only Begotten Son, could be born on the foundation the chosen people of Israel had made. Finally, a son who could receive and experience the first love of Heavenly Parent had been born, and for the first time the cry of a son calling out to God as \\\"Abba\\\" (\\\"my Father\\\") could resound throughout the heavens. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"68\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"It was Jesus, the Only Begotten Son, who was the substantial form of Heavenly Father. Saying, \\\"He who has seen me has seen the Father,\\\" (John 14:9, RSV) Jesus revealed that the people were seeing Heavenly Father in him. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"40\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"For the first time, humanity could meet Heavenly Father, through Jesus. They had moved from the position of servants to the position of adopted children, so the path to a personal relationship where people could call God \\\"Father\\\" was opened up through Jesus. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"44\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Jesus died on the cross because the religious leaders and the people of the time had been unable to fulfill their responsibility, the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter was ultimately blocked. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"34\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Just as the people of the world were able to meet Heavenly Father through the Only Begotten Son Jesus, if the Only Begotten Daughter, the substantial form of Heavenly Mother, had been born at that time, humankind could have met Heavenly Mother as well. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"45\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The fact that humankind found God the Father through the Only Begotten Son Jesus was a great leap forward providentially. But on the other hand, the postponement of the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter, leaving people still unaware of Heavenly Mother, caused Heavenly Parent great pain. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"48\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Finally, after 6,000 years of biblical history, the Only Begotten Daughter True Mother was born on this earth in 1943. Through the Only Begotten Daughter True Mother, Heavenly Mother, who had been hidden throughout history, was revealed, and thus, we are now living in the time when Heavenly Parent can be fully welcomed on this earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"57\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Now the era has been opened when we can meet substantially Heavenly Father through True Father and Heavenly Mother through True Mother. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"23\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Because of the complete unity between Heavenly Parent and True Parents, they have manifested as the True Parents of Heaven, Earth and Humankind 天地人真父母. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"25\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Since Foundation Day, because the era of Cheon Il Guk is the era of living while substantially attending the True Parents of Heaven, Earth, and Humankind who have achieved the final unity, the name of God must become Heavenly Parent rather than God the Father. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"46\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The name of God changed from Yahweh to God the Father, and then to Heavenly Parent as the providence progressed. God is an unchanging God, but now, at the conclusion of the providence, God is revealing the true name and nature of God as Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"47\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent had a dream. That dream was to give birth to all of humankind as sons and daughters whom Heavenly Parent could love completely, and to realize a world where they and Heavenly Parent could share limitless love and experience eternal joy and happiness together. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"47\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Because our first ancestors, Adam and Eve, fell after failing to keep the commandment \\\"Do not eat\\\" that Heavenly Parent had given to help them reach perfection, the world that has developed over the course of human history is one with a fallen lineage unrelated to the lineage of Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"52\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"To restore fallen people, and give them rebirth as sons and daughters of goodness who have inherited Heavenly Parent\'s lineage, and to establish Cheon Il Guk, the ideal world where Heavenly Parent can personally dwell, Heavenly Parent selected Israel as the chosen people and central nation that, in accordance with Heavenly Parent\'s Will, would carry out the providence of restoration among fallen humanity. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"64\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The chosen people of Israel had the mission to attend and follow Heavenly Parent, inherit Heavenly Parent\'s lineage, and give birth to the Only Begotten Son and Only Begotten Daughter who were to become the True Parents of humankind. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"40\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Through three generations—Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob—Heavenly Parent established the foundation for the restoration of the lineage through which the Only Begotten Son and Only Begotten Daughter could be sent, and established the chosen people of Israel. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"37\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After 2,000 years, a national foundation centered on the chosen people of Israel had been established, and during the era of the Roman Empire, the necessary environment had been prepared to send the Only Begotten Son and Only Begotten Daughter who would become the True Parents. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"47\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After 4,000 years of the providence of restoration through indemnity, Heavenly Parent was finally able, through Mary, to bring about the birth of Jesus, the Only Begotten Son, who inherited Heavenly Parent\'s lineage. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"34\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Mary, who was betrothed to Joseph, received the revelation that she would give birth to the Only Begotten Son, and with absolute faith decided to accept Heavenly Parent\'s Will. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Mary went to the house of Zechariah, a respected high priest who was her relative and the father of John the Baptist. While she was there, Zechariah\'s wife Elizabeth testified to Mary\'s conception of Jesus. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"36\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent made Mary, Zachariah, and Elizabeth the first to know of Jesus\' conception. These were people with the crucial mission to attend and support Jesus, who would be born as the Only Begotten Son, and to obey Heavenly Parent\'s Will. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"42\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After 4,000 years of history as recorded in the Bible, Jesus, who was sent by Heaven as Heavenly Parent\'s Only Begotten Son who was to become one of the True Parents of humankind, was conceived by the Holy Spirit in Mary\'s prepared womb. For the first time, the Only Begotten Son, who could uniquely receive Heavenly Parent\'s first love, was born on earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"64\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"As Jesus was growing up, he engaged in dialogue with Heavenly Parent, he came to personally experience the world of Heavenly Parent\'s heart and to perfect his own heart. In complete oneness of heart with Heavenly Parent. he lived as a person of perfected individual character, a pure man preparing to ascend to the position of True Parents, which our first ancestors had been meant to accomplish in the original Garden of Eden. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"76\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Jesus was to become humanity\'s True Father. Having reached perfection as an individual, Jesus was to meet the Only Begotten Daughter at Heaven\'s appointed time, and together they would participate in the Holy Wedding to become the True Parents of humankind. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"42\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Jesus, the Only Begotten Son, remained completely one in heart with Heavenly Parent until his final moments despite having to face crucifixion due to the failure of the central figures who should have attended and supported him during his public ministry. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"42\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Even at the critical moment, facing death, Jesus thought first of Heavenly Parent and humanity. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"16\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In the Garden of Gethsemane, Jesus shed desperate tears in prayer, with a heart grieving not for his own life but out of the sorrow that Heavenly Parent\'s providence would have to be extended. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"35\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Jesus showed humankind a model of true love by comforting Heaven and asking that those who had driven the one who was meant to become the True Father of humanity to his crucifixion be granted forgiveness. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"37\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Jesus came as the Only Begotten Son, and the victorious foundation that he left as the Only Begotten Son will remain for all eternity. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"25\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Jesus born as Heavenly Parent\'s Only Begotten Son, he needed a protective environment to fulfill God\'s Will so that he can advance to the position of True Parents together with the Only Begotten Daughter after he reached perfection under Heavenly Parent\'s protection. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"43\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent also hoped that Mary together with her husband Joseph would protect Jesus. However, after his birth, Jesus did not end up receiving protection from Zechariah\'s family and had to grow up in difficult circumstances, lonely and struggling, without proper support from Joseph. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"45\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Mary, as Jesus\' mother, had the mission to provide the environment and support that Jesus needed to advance to the position of True Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"25\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Mary\'s responsibility was to prioritize the providence over her personal family life by protecting and supporting Jesus. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"18\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Mary while living a regular family life with Joseph, lost sight of her vertical standard. Mary had the mission to attend Jesus, but since she ended up relating to Jesus from a humanistic perspective she failed to fulfill her public mission. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"42\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"John the Baptist, who had brought the people to repentance, had the responsibility to guide them to believe in and follow Jesus. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"23\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Although Zechariah, Elizabeth, and John the Baptist did testify to Jesus as the Son of Heavenly Parent, unfortunately, none of them stood by him until the end. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"28\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Joseph could not overcome his doubts about Jesus\' birth, and he wanted to pursue a normal married life with his betrothed Mary, which finally made it impossible for him to fulfill his mission to protect Jesus. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"39\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Mary viewing Jesus, who came as the Only Begotten Son and the Messiah, as her own son, she was unable to understand him or to support him effectively in his desired course to meet the Only Begotten Daughter and hold the Holy Wedding. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"45\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The religious leaders did not fully comprehend Jesus\' words, they opposed him, accusing him of being a lawbreaker because he did not adhere to the laws of the faith, a blasphemer because he called God his Father and disturbed the temple, and an agitator who was misleading the Jewish people with miracles. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"54\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Mary and Joseph, Zechariah\'s family, the religious leaders, and the people of Israel of the time, whom Heavenly Parent had prepared to support Jesus, born as the Only Begotten Son, were unaware of Jesus\' essence, that he was to become the True Father of humankind. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"46\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Mary and Joseph, Zechariah\'s family, the religious leaders, and the people of Israel of the time, caught up in humanistic perspectives and self-centered desires, they lost sight of their mission to attend and follow Jesus and did not fulfill their responsibility. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"44\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Due to the critical failures of the central figures whom Heavenly Parent had prepared to support the completion of Jesus’ mission including his mother Mary, Joseph, Zechariah, Elizabeth, and John the Baptist, Jesus was left without the environment and support he needed to fulfill his mission. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"48\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Due to the critical failures of the central figures whom Heavenly Parent had prepared to support the completion of Jesus’ mission, he had to leave home to establish a new spiritual foundation, calling people one by one to become his disciples and conveying God\'s words to them. This became the start of Jesus\' public ministry. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"57\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Due to the opposition of religious leaders who felt threatened by Jesus, the disbelief of the people who followed the guidance of the religious leaders, and the weakening faith of his disciples, Jesus, who should have advanced to the position of True Parent of humankind, (had to take the path) of the cross. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"55\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"If Mary, Joseph, and Zechariah\'s family, whom Heavenly Parent had prepared, had understood God\'s Will and united to fulfill their responsibility of creating the foundation for the Only Begotten Daughter\'s birth, she would have been born at that time as Heavenly Parent had planned. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"46\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Due to the failure of Mary, Zechariah\'s family, and the people to fulfill their responsibilities, the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter was thwarted. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"26\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Through Jesus public ministry, he was able to reveal our Heavenly Parent as our Father, to leave behind a victorious foundation as the Only Begotten Son, and to establish the foundation for the beginnings of Christianity through which the Only Begotten Daughter could later be born. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"48\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Through Jesus death on the cross, Jesus gave his physical body as a sacrifice to Satan, for the salvation of all humanity. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After Jesus resurrection, he walked a 40-day course on earth, pioneering the path to atone for all the sins of humankind. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"23\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The disciples who accepted and believed in the resurrected Jesus gathered once again, reestablishing twelve central supporting disciples. Through their believing in, attending, and following Jesus with their lives they laid the foundation for Christianity, which began the foundation for the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter and for the Second Coming of Jesus. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"56\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The path of the cross that Jesus walked became the condition of indemnity that allowed him to resurrect and appear spiritually on earth, and through the unity of Jesus and his disciples over the course of his 40 days of resurrection, the foundation was established for the future work of the Holy Spirit. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"55\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Jesus promised his disciples that he would return. However, since Jesus had met his death, he could not come again in the flesh; thus when Jesus\' Second Coming occurs, it will be through a new person who inherits his mission. This person is the Messiah at the Second Advent who will be able to complete the path of True Parents that Jesus was meant to walk. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"69\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The one who becomes the Messiah at the Second Advent will receive his calling to take up the mission, building on Jesus\' successful foundation, and complete Jesus\' remaining portion of responsibility. This means he must find the Only Begotten Daughter and fulfill the ideal of True Parents through the Marriage Supper of the Lamb. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"56\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Book of Revelation, the final book of the Bible, prophesies that the kingdom of peace sought by the almighty Heavenly Parent begins with Marriage Supper of the Lamb—the Returning Lord—and includes the blessing, “Behold, I am coming Blessed is he who keeps the words of the prophecy of this book\\\" (Rev 22:7) and that the Spirit and the Bride will give the water of life (Rev 22:17). \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"71\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The ultimate purpose of Jesus\' Second Coming is to advance to the position of True Parents by meeting the Only Begotten Daughter and holding the Holy Wedding, the Marriage Supper of the Lamb. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"35\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Christianity\'s mission is to welcome the Only Begotten Daughter, prepare for the Marriage Supper of the Lamb between the Only Begotten Daughter and the one who will become the Messiah at the Second Advent, and to attend the True Parents. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"42\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Αfter Jesus\' death on the cross, his Apostles dispersed, but the resurrected Jesus appeared to them and called them back together again. On the 50th day after Jesus\' resurrection, the Holy Spirit descended upon his gathered believers including the Apostles. Filled with the Holy Spirit, they went out into the world to spread Jesus\' message. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"57\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Christianity became Heavenly Parent\'s mainstream providential religion for sending the Only Begotten Daughter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"16\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Apostles compiled the words and deeds of Jesus, which were written up in the Gospels and they established and developed the early church by sending letters giving guidance about life of faith to their congregations throughout the mission field. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"42\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Apostles and prophets such as Peter and Paul traveled to various regions to preach the gospel and visit local churches as they led the development of the church. They were strongly opposed and persecuted by the Roman Empire, but they persevered and maintained their faith, and the number of Christians steadily increased. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"54\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Christianity was officially recognized through Emperor Constantine\'s Edict of Milan in 313 AD, giving Christians religious freedom, and then, in 392 AD, Emperor Theodosius adopted Christianity as the state religion throughout the Roman Empire. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"36\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When the Holy Roman Emperor was crowned by the Pope in 800 AD, Christianity became the spiritual mainstream for all of Western Europe and established firm roots in Eastern Europe and the Near East through the Byzantine Empire. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"40\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"It was believers who had directly witnessed the resurrection of the crucified and risen Christ and experienced the work of the Holy Spirit, including the newly reborn Apostles, who gave Christianity its start. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"35\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Through the New Testament, which is based on the words of Jesus and the experiences of the Apostles, they passed on and spread the Christian faith. As time went on, the church bishops, whose authority had been handed down from the Apostles who themselves received direct instruction from Jesus, took on the tasks of interpreting the scriptures. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"59\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The relationship between clergy and believers gradually became hierarchical and polarized, with the clergy coming to stand between believers and God. As this continued, Christian leaders were unable to create a spiritual foundation capable of guiding believers during developing and changing times. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"45\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent inspired the reformation and rebirth of Christianity in the middle of the second millennium AD, and this providential plan of Heavenly Parent manifested as the Protestant Reformation. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"31\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In medieval Europe, there was serious degradation and corruption of clergy who colluded with secular power, including simony and the sale of indulgences that eventually led to reformation. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"31\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Protestant Reformation that arose in response to the failings of the Catholic Church in 16th century Europe spread throughout Europe, sparked by Martin Luther\'s 1517 presentation of his 95 Theses criticizing the sale of indulgences. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"38\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Martin Luther scathingly condemned the corruption in the Catholic Church and became increasingly critical of certain Catholic practices and doctrines. He vehemently opposed the sale of indulgences, which the church used as a method of raising money. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"39\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Martin Luther believed that salvation should be based solely on faith and God\'s grace, not pursued through purchasing indulgences or conditions of good works (merit). \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"27\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Martin Luther believed that faith in Jesus, as revealed in the Scriptures, was the only means of salvation, and rejected the idea that the church and its traditions could be considered as holding ultimate authority, because as human institutions, they are fallible. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"44\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The subsequent development of Reformation theology by other reformers such as John Calvin and Ulrich Zwingli gave rise to the formation of Protestant denominations that broke away from the Catholic Church. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"33\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The main theological ideas of the Reformation started by Luther were systematized through John Calvin, marking the establishment of Protestant theology. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In 1543, Calvin published a thesis entitled The Necessity of Reforming the Church, which he submitted to the Emperor and Imperial Diet of the Holy Roman Empire the following year. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"32\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Calvin emphasized the importance of knowing God the Creator and Jesus Christ, while also seeking to clarify the path to receiving Christ\'s grace, and illuminating the objectives of the church and the state. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"35\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Calvin is considered to have completed the drive toward the Reformation which had been initiated by Martin Luther, Ulrich Zwingli, and others, by facilitating the implementation of a \\\"priesthood of all believers,\\\" advocated by Martin Luther, in churches and worship services. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"44\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Reformation initiated by Martin Luther, Ulrich Zwingli, and others, was a reformation of worship practices toward worship centered on the Word rather than on liturgy, and of interpretation of the Bible through the illumination of the Holy Spirit. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"41\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Reformation challenged the traditional authority of the Catholic Church, leading to significant changes in religious practice, education, and governance in the society of its time. It spurred the development of democratic political systems and an awakening to individual liberty and rights. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"44\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After the Reformation, those who embraced Protestantism faced much persecution in the European countries where the Catholic Church was still the mainstream of faith and was protected by political power. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"32\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After the Reformation, those who embraced Protestantism faced much persecution in the European countries. Among them, the Puritans in particular departed for the New World in search of true religious freedom so they could attend Heaven and worship as they wished. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"43\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When the Pilgrims arrived in America in 1620, they first built a church to attend God, then a school to educate their children, the new generation. Only after that did they build homes to live in. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"38\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Pilgrims that arrived in America in 1620 were determined to create a country where they could worship God freely. Today, the phrase \\\"In God We Trust\\\" appears on US currency and is a symbol of this unwavering faith. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"42\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The United States of America is a country established about 250 years ago (as of 2026) by the descendants of the Puritans and others who inherited the spirit of the Reformation and sought to purify the Christian faith. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"41\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heaven blessed America with a strong Protestant foundation and nurtured it as a nation representing the Christian spirit and democracy to create an environment that could welcome and support the True Parents and avoid the repetition of history where Jesus had to go the way of the cross. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"51\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heaven sought to work through democracy to protect the providence from being frustrated by the unsound judgment of any single absolute monarch. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"America after the Puritans and other settlers crossed the Atlantic from Europe, and then extended across the Pacific to establish Christianity among the Korean people, aided by the work of American Protestant missionaries. This laid the Christian foundation for the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter on the Korean Peninsula. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"53\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After its 2000-year history, Christianity must now come to correctly understand the truth of history and the truth of Heavenly Parent\'s providence. The truth of Heavenly Parent\'s providence is that the Only Begotten Son and Only Begotten Daughter, are born in Heavenly Parent\'s lineage, completely receiving Heavenly Parent\'s love, and, through the Marriage Supper of the Lamb, are to become the True Parents who perfectly resemble Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"70\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent\'s providence is to first bring forth the births of the Only Begotten Son and Only Begotten Daughter and have them grow to maturity and become the True Parents, who will then carry out the providence of restoring all of humanity. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"45\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Christianity must understand the essence of Jesus, who was sent and prepared through 4,000 years of biblical history. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"21\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Christians must be aware of Jesus\' intended purpose and will, and why he said he would return. Furthermore, Christianity must understand its mission in the current age, after 2,000 years have passed. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"35\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Jesus, who inherited Heavenly Parent\'s love and lineage from birth, successfully grew to maturity and perfected himself as Heavenly Parent\'s Only Begotten Son. Jesus was meant to advance to the position of True Parents by meeting the perfected Only Begotten Daughter and participating with her in the Marriage Supper of the Lamb. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"55\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Because Mary, Zechariah\'s family, and the people who should have attended and supported Jesus did not believe in him, the Only Begotten Daughter could not be born, and Jesus had no choice but to go the way of the cross. Today\'s Christianity must clearly understand this reality. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"50\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When Christianity strayed from its essence during the Middle Ages, Heavenly Parent renewed the Christian faith through the Reformation and prepared for the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"31\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Only Begotten Daughter was born by Heaven\'s providence in 1943, 400 years after John Calvin wrote his thesis in 1543 proclaiming the necessity for reformation, which he submitted to the Holy Roman Emperor. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"36\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"What is it that Christianity should do now? The Christian world must welcome the Only Begotten Daughter, who was born after 6000 years of the history of the providence of restoration, and recognize the Messiah at the Second Advent who has come to inherit the mission of Jesus, the Only Begotten Son, who went the way of the cross. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"61\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After the Only Begotten Daughter and the Messiah at the Second Advent become the True Parents through the Marriage Supper of the Lamb, Christianity must take the lead in attending and following True Parents, helping humanity to be reborn as Heavenly Parent\'s sons and daughters, and completing Cheon Il Guk, the ideal world where people can directly experience Heavenly Parent\'s sovereignty. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"64\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The purpose of the 2,000-year providential history after Jesus\' crucifixion was to prepare for the Only Begotten Daughter to be sent. However, because the people of Israel had indemnity remaining due to the crucifixion of the Only Begotten Son Jesus, Heavenly Parent could not send the Only Begotten Daughter through them. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"54\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Instead of working through the people of Israel who had been unable to complete their responsibility, Heavenly Parent prepared for the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter through a separate chosen people. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"34\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heaven chose a new people to prepare the foundation for the Only Begotten Daughter in case it could not be completed at the time of Jesus, and that new chosen people was the Han people of Korea. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"39\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent chose the Han people of Korea for the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter. A group from among the descendants of Shem migrated eastward; these were the Dongyi東夷 (“Eastern Yi”)people. The Han people, as descendants of the Dongyi, established the Korean Han dynasty and later settled on the Korean Peninsula. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"56\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Through a long history spanning 5,000 years, Heavenly Parent raised the Han people of Korea as the chosen people. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"22\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent raised the Han people of Korea as the chosen people, and after Jesus\' crucifixion, Heavenly Parent\'s providence to give birth to the Only Begotten Daughter proceeded centered on the Han people as the chosen people. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"39\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The history of the Han people as the chosen people was a providential history that Heavenly Parent personally guided to prepare for the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"32\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent renewed Christianity through the Protestant Reformation. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"10\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Reformation was Heaven\'s work to prepare the new Christian foundation necessary for sending the Only Begotten Daughter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"21\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Institutes of the Christian Religion is a theological work in which Calvin systematically organized the core doctrines of Protestant theology to effect reform by cleaning away the corruption that had developed in the Catholic Church and 1543 was the year when the Institutes of the Christian Religion was substantively completed. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"53\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Protestant Reformation sought to build Heavenly Parent\'s nation by confessing their faith through an unshakable belief in Heavenly Parent and practicing a righteous life. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"27\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The core of the Protestant Reformation was that individual believers could receive salvation by having genuine faith based on the Bible. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"23\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Upon the foundation of the Reformation, Heavenly Parent established a sufficient foundation among faithful believers to make it possible to send the Only Begotten Daughter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"26\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The faith of the Puritans that grew into the founding spirit of the United States after the Protestant Reformation led to a movement of spiritual awakenings to renew and revive faith. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"33\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Puritan movement that took place from 1560 to 1660 was a religious movement aimed at reforming the church, which had become buried in formalism with too strong an emphasis on rites and rituals. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"36\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Puritans practiced a strict disciplined life while maintaining a devout faith in God. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"16\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Puritans after migrating to the American continent in search of religious freedom, they sought to create God\'s nation. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"21\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Puritan spirit gradually lost its strength due to the spread of materialism and individualism caused by the development of capitalism, and the secularization of American society. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"29\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Third Great Awakening, which began in 1850, had a broad ecumenical base, and was supported with leadership from many lay members. They emphasized preparing for Christ\'s Second Coming while devoting themselves to the church through rebirth and a God-centered life, and experienced diverse works of the Holy Spirit. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"52\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"One of the evangelists of the Awakening, Dwight Lyman Moody, emphasized conversion through the experience of the Holy Spirit and preached that young believers should go out as foreign missionaries. Some of the young missionaries inspired by his message came to evangelize in Korea and formed the foundation for Protestantism on the Korean Peninsula. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"56\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"America\'s spiritual awakening movement led to a spiritual revival within Korean Christianity. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"14\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Korea had a long-standing tradition and culture of attending Heavenly Parent, the Korean people accepted Christianity with a fervor stronger than that seen in other countries. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"27\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The history of Catholicism in Korea began during the Joseon朝鲜 period when Yi Byeok, Kwon Cheol-shin and others studied Catholic teachings from an academic perspective based on books and writings that had been brought in through China. In 1784. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"41\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \" Yi Seung-hun went to China to receive baptism. This was an unprecedented case of a convert accepting Catholicism and seeking out a priest for baptism without the involvement of foreign missionaries. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"34\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"A Joseon Korean convert named Seo Sang-ryun baptized by a Presbyterian missionary in Manchuria, translated the New Testament into Korean. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"21\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Lee Su-jung, who converted to Protestantism in Japan in 1883, translated the Gospel of Mark into Korean, making preparations so that missionaries could receive Korean Bibles to bring with them when they traveled from Japan to Joseon Korea, and even taught Korean to some of the missionaries including Underwood and Appenzeller. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"53\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When missionaries Underwood and Appenzeller arrived in Joseon in 1885 this kind of foundation had already been prepared. These young missionaries were people who prayed and offered daily devotions, earnestly hoping for the Second Coming of Christ to occur during their lifetime. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"45\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Despite periodic religious persecution by the Joseon 朝鲜 Korean government, the Korean people actively accepted Christianity and participated enthusiastically in spiritual revivals. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Pyongyang Great Revival Movement平壤大復興運動 in 1907 featured widespread confession of sins and repentance before Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"19\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After many revival movements in early 1900s, the number of Koreans who prayed and prepared with devout faith to meet the Lord at the Second Coming increased, and a national foundation was formed that could receive the Only Begotten Daughter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"42\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent prepared a Christian environment centered on Spirit-led Christian groups. The time when the Only Begotten Daughter True Mother was born was when Japanese colonial rule had reached its peak. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"33\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Japanese colonial government enforced worship at Shinto shrines around 1925. However, this met with fierce opposition from the intellectuals in Joseon Korean society. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"25\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Japanese colonial government enforced worship at Shinto shrines around 1925. Most Korean Christians, especially those who were most devout, resisted and did not comply with the orders demanding Shinto shrine worship. Heavenly Parent sent revelations to those who prayed, and they became part of a special foundation to send the Only Begotten Daughter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"55\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"During the Japanese colonial government oppression in Korea, many Korean spiritual groups were formed and through these spiritual groups, Heavenly Parent prepared the Korean people to meet the Messiah at the Second Coming while simultaneously establishing the foundation for the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter, the substantial Holy Spirit. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"52\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \" True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, was born among the chosen Korean people. Her birth came upon the foundation of Christian revival in Korea that grew out of the Awakenings that arose around the world and the devotion of Korea\'s Spirit-led Christian groups. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"46\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Jesus Christ, the Messiah whom God had sent, said, \\\"I will come again.\\\" This tells us of his desire to return for the Marriage Supper of the Lamb. Coming for the Marriage Supper of the Lamb means that he comes to meet his intended bride. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"46\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father has said that the one who would become the Mother of the Universe must come from a family of three generations of only daughters. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"28\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"During the period of Japanese colonial oppression in Korea, many spirit-led Christian groups were offering prayer and devotions after receiving revelations that the Lord would not come on the clouds but would come to the Korean Peninsula in the flesh. Among these Spirit-led groups, Heavenly Parent prepared a family with three generations of only daughters. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"57\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \" The foundation of the special prayers and devotions offered by these Spirit-led groups was passed down to Grandmother Jo Won-mo, True Mother\'s maternal grandmother, and Hong Soon-ae 洪顺爱 Daemo nim, True Mother\'s mother. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"36\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Daemo nim attended the Presbyterian Church until she was 19, and after being guided by her mother, Jo Won-mo, to connect with Spirit-led groups she dedicated herself to a life of faith to receive the Returning Lord. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"39\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In 1933, for three years Daemo nim and her mother attended Pastor Lee Yong-do\'s New Jesus Church, where they repented daily and prayed in tears to receive the Returning Lord. For the following eight years. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"38\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"From 1936, Daemo nim maintained a faithful religious life while attending the Holy Lord Church led by Mrs. Kim Seong-do, and for four years from 1944, she participated in preparing to receive the Returning Lord at the Inside the Womb Church of Mrs. Heo Ho-bin, who had inherited Kim Seongdo\'s mission. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"52\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The family-level foundation for the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter was established through grandmother Jo Won-mo and Daemo nim mother-daughter cooperation, expressed in their devout religious lives in Christian churches and spiritual groups. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"35\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother\'s father, Han Seung-oon 韓承運 Daebu nim was one of the earliest members of Pastor Lee Yong-do\'s New Jesus Church, established in 1933, where Daebunim served as the director of education at the central training center. Because of his deep faith, he was entrusted with overseeing the education programs at the New Jesus Church under the guidance of pastors Lee Yong-do and his successor Lee Ho-bin, who took over after Lee Yong-do\'s early death from tuberculosis. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"79\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Han Seung-oon Daebu nim(韓承運 大父 ) and Hong Soon-ae 洪顺爱 Daemo nim, the parents of the Only Begotten Daughter, met through Heavenly Parent\'s guidance while both were leading devout religious lives at the New Jesus Church. They were married on March 5, 1934, with Pastor Lee Ho-bin, the spiritual leader of the New Jesus Church, officiating the ceremony. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"60\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Pastor Lee Ho-bin testified to having received a revelation that \\\"if this virtuous man (True Mother\'s father) and woman (True Mother\'s mother) marry and have a daughter, she will become the queen of humankind.” \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"37\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Daemo nim received a special revelation from Heaven before her marriage, about the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter. \\\"Rejoice, daughter of Hong Il-yu(True Mother\'s grandmother)! If your child is a son, he will become the king of the universe, and if a daughter, she will become the queen of the universe.\\\" \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"53\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"On the 6th day of the 1st month (same with TF) by the lunar calendar in 1943, at 26 Shinui-ri, Anju-eup, Anju-gun, South Pyongan Province (平安南道安州郡) , Han Hak-Ja, the Only Begotten Daughter whom Heaven had longed for throughout the 6,000-year providence, was born. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"45\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Han Seung-oon(韓承運) Daebu nim had a vision of two cranes playing together in a dense pine forest bathed in clear, beautiful sunlight, so he chose the name \\\"Hak-ja\\\" (\\\"crane child\\\") for his new daughter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"35\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When the the Only Begotten Daughter was born, Satan appeared in Daemo nim\'s dream and tried to kill her new baby, saying, \\\"Because of this baby\'s birth, I will die and my world will disappear.\\\" Daemo nim fought Satan all night to protect her new baby and afterward offered even more prayer and devotions to ensure the protection and proper upbringing of the Only Begotten Daughter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"67\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After Daemo nim had given birth to her precious daughter, the leader of the Holy Lord Church (TM’s parents married in this church), Mrs. Kim Seong-do, appeared to Daemo nim in a vision and offered her blessing on them, saying, \\\"Soon-ae, are you worried about your baby? Don\'t worry. This baby is the Lord\'s daughter and you are like her nanny. Just nurse her well and raise her.\\\" This revealed that the Only Begotten Daughter was born as Heavenly Parent\'s daughter, and her mother was instructed to raise her as if she were her nanny. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"96\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In the year when Han Hak-ja, the Only Begotten Daughter, reached the age of five, the mother of Mrs. Heo Ho-bin, who was the leader of the Inside the Womb Church, received a revelation about the Only Begotten Daughter. She testified about young Han Hak-ja, saying, \\\"She is the daughter of God the Creator\\\" and \\\"She will become the mother of the universe.\\\" \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"64\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Grandmother Jo Won-mo emphasized to her, “Your father is God the Father!\\\" helping her feel \\\"Heavenly Parent is my father.\\\" Meanwhile Daemo nim raised her \\\"with the heart of a nanny” maintaining strict standards so that she could grow up pure and devout. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"44\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When the Only Begotten Daughter, Han Hak-ja was five years old, to protect her, Heavenly Parent guided her grandmother Jo Won-mo and mother, Daemo nim so their family could journey safely to the south before the Korean War began. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"40\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother\'s hometown was in North Korea, even when the communist regime took control, at first True Mother\'s family did not consider going south. However, since Heaven had to protect the Only Begotten Daughter, in 1948, when she was five years old, Heavenly Parent guided the family to go south. Less than two years after they journeyed south, the Korean War broke out. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"64\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When Daemo nim was detained for 11 days by the communist authorities for being a follower of the Inside the Womb Church, Grandmother Jo Won-mo made the decision that they must journey south. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"34\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"As Grandmother Jo Won-mo, Hong Soon-ae Daemo nim, and Han Hak-ja the Only Begotten Daughter journeyed to the south and arrived near the border between the two Koreas at the 38th parallel, they were stopped by the North Korean People\'s Army and imprisoned in an empty shed. Through Heaven\'s protection, however, they were safely released after several days. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"59\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"As Grandmother Jo Won-mo, Hong Soon-ae Daemo nim, and Han Hak-ja the Only Begotten Daughter journeyed south and approaching the border, South Korean soldiers heard the family coming and raised their weapons. At that moment, the young Han Hak-ja managed to avert the crisis by singing a folksong. Upon hearing the young child\'s sweet voice singing, the soldiers lowered their rifles and warmly welcomed the group. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"67\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When the Korean War broke out, Heavenly Parent led 16 UN nations to participate in the war to protect the Only Begotten Daughter and keep her safe during her time as a war refugee. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"37\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Though Korea was a small country not well known to the world, 16 UN nations participated in the war and shed blood for the sake to protect the Only Begotten Daughter who was born 6,000 years after the start of the providence of restoration. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"45\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The support and sacrifice of the young soldiers from these 16 nations led by UN was a welcome and profound blessing and represented Heavenly Parent\'s love for humankind. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"29\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"On June 27, 1950, two days after the Korean War broke out, the family of the Only Begotten Daughter began their life as refugees. While walking toward the Han River in the night rain, the young Han Hak-ja sensed danger and grabbed Grandmother Jo Won-mo\'s skirt. Surprised by this sudden action, Grandmother Jo looked to Heaven to think, and then they all turned around and returned to their house. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"71\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When young Han Hak-ja sensed danger while the family was walking toward the Han River, she grabbed Grandmother Jo Won-mo\'s skirt, the family then turned around and returned to their house. Remarkably, that night Uncle Soon-jeong, an officer in the South Korean army, came to their home in a military vehicle, and drove them across the Han river so they could evacuate from Seoul. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"65\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Shortly after the Only Begotten Daughter and her family crossed the Han River in her uncle\'s vehicle, there was a loud \\\"boom\\\" as the bridge they had just crossed was blown up. Heaven had worked to protect the Only Begotten Daughter. Having witnessed the horrors of war firsthand, Han Hak-ja grew up offering devotions with gratitude for Heaven\'s protection even during her family\'s desperate life as war refugees. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"69\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"During Han Hak-ja\'s school days, she was loved by her teachers and friends as an exemplary student with proper and modest conduct. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Han Hak-ja lived a pure life like a nun, enjoying reading and music in a quiet environment. Additionally, everyone was impressed by her confident demeanor when she gave speeches in front of the entire student body as a student leader. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"41\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In March 1956, Daemo nim and the Only Begotten Daughter met Rev. Moon Sun-myung for the first time in Seoul, at the original Cheongpa-dong Headquarters Church. Upon seeing Han Hak-ja, the Only Begotten Daughter, he exclaimed three times \\\"Han Hak-ja has been born in the Republic of Korea!\\\" and then prayed \\\"God! Thank you for sending such an exceptional woman named Han Hak-ja to Korea.”\",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"64\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"During Han Hak-jan childhood, while reading the Bible, she would shed tears reading about God\'s history of salvation through central figures, and she cherished the dream of resolving the deep sorrow (han) of Heavenly Parent, who had been guiding history to save humankind. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"44\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In autumn 1959, Han Hak-ja had grown up pure and devout, understanding Heaven\'s Will by herself and had achieved perfection as a pure woman. About this time, Heavenly Parent appeared directly to her and told her, \\\"Because I am the Alpha and Omega, I have been waiting for the Mother of the Universe since before the Creation,\\\" and instructed her to prepare for the Marriage Supper of the Lamb. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"70\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"On February 26, 1960, at the Cheongpa-dong Church, the Only Begotten Daughter and Rev. Moon Sun Myung met again. At this meeting, Rev. Moon declared that Han Hak-ja would become the True Mother who would be blessed by God to enable all humankind as numerous as the stars in the sky and the grains of sand by the sea to be reborn as good children. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"66\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \" On February 26, 1960, when Rev. Moon declared that Han Hak-ja would become the True Mother who would be blessed by God, she as the Only Begotten Daughter for whom Heaven had waited for 6,000 years, had deeply experienced Heaven\'s heart and resolved, \\\"I must make my determination and step forward now. I will do it.\\\" \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"59\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"On the day of the Holy Wedding, after the ceremonies had been completed the Only Begotten Daughter tearfully said, \\\"God\'s heart cannot be described in words. I pledge to move forward in unity with all of you, both in heart and in every aspect, until the day the Will is fulfilled.\\\" \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"54\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, was born into Heavenly Parent\'s love and lineage with a Christian background on the foundation created by the chosen Han people of Korea. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"31\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Daemo nim received a revelation from Heaven that \\\"the Queen of the Universe will be born,\\\" and Pastor Lee Ho-bin testified that \\\"when this good man and woman marry and have a daughter, she will become the queen of humankind.\\\" \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"43\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The birth of the Only Begotten Daughter was solely the result of Heavenly Parent\'s Will. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"17\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, achieved individual perfection by living according to God\'s principles of creation. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"18\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother received through direct dialogue with Heavenly Parent while experiencing the world of Heavenly Parent\'s heart. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"19\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After 6,000 years of history, True Parents had finally appeared. True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, completed the ideal of the True Parents, Heavenly Parent\'s heartfelt hope. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"29\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, has achieved perfection in the position of True Parent and has been concretely realizing Heavenly Parent\'s dream. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"25\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"As a True Parent, Trlue Mother, the Only Begotten Dauaghter enabled the completion of the four-position foundation in heaven and on earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, is realizing the “ideal world of one family of humankind\\\" where blessed families worldwide substantially attend and live together with Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In 2013, as the True Parent of Heaven, Earth and Humankind -Heavenly Parent and True Parents in oneness- True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter established Cheon Il Guk and proclaimed Foundation Day, initiating the first year of Cheon Il Guk. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"43\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In 2013, through the Foundation Day Registration Blessing, True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter granted the grace for all blessed families to be registered as citizens of Cheon Il Guk. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"32\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, opened Cheon Il Guk in 2013 and has worked to create the necessary environment and all the conditions for Heavenly Parent to be attended substantially in the Cheon Won Gung Cheonil Sanctum in 2025. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"41\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, has completed the four-position foundation of the True Parents\' family and has laid the foundation to be able to attend Heavenly Parent substantially through the Cheonbo providence. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"35\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother has built and dedicated the Cheon Won Gung Cheonil Sanctum as Heavenly Parent\'s dwelling place, and has guided the preparation of Chambumo Ron, The Epic History of the Chosen Han People of Korea, and the 14 Cheonil Seonghwa artworks. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"43\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter and Substantial Holy Spirit, opened the era when blessed families worldwide can substantially attend Heavenly Parent, the Creator, while welcoming the 13th year(In 2025) of Cheon Il Guk with the Cheon Won Gung Cheonil Sanctum Entrance Ceremony. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"44\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter and Substantial Holy Spirit, has been victorious as the central pillar for the completion of the providence working as the True Parents of Heaven, Earth and Humankind following the complete unity of the True Parents with Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"46\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter proclaimed the truth of Heaven\'s providence by revealing the essence of Heavenly Parent, True Parents, Jesus, and Christianity, thereby opening an era of new creation. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"33\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"It is the Only Begotten Daughter that brings the providence to completion. It is completed through the Only Begotten Daughter, True Mother, Wang Omma. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"26\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The era of Cheon Il Guk is an era of finding and establishing a new order by attending True Mother, the Substantial Holy Spirit and Only Begotten Daughter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother is God\'s Only Begotten Daughter, born for the first time after 6,000 years. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"17\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"On the foundation of 4,000 years of effort, Heavenly Parent gave birth to Jesus, the Only Begotten Son, of whom God could say \\\"He is my son!\\\" Jesus\' birth as the Only Begotten Son means he was born in Heavenly Parent\'s lineage, separated from the lineage of fallen humanity. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"51\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Jesus, the Only Begotten Son, as a son in Heavenly Parent\'s direct lineage, could relate and communicate directly with Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"23\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Only Begotten Son is the only son who can receive Heavenly Parent\'s first love in its entirety. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"20\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Jesus, born as the Only Begotten Son, could not complete the ideal of True Parents alone. According to the principles of creation, the Only Begotten Son must meet the Only Begotten Daughter to be able to complete the ideal of True Parents. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"44\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, is the only daughter who can receive Heavenly Parent\'s first love in its entirety. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"21\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, was born as a daughter in Heavenly Parent\'s direct lineage, with Heavenly Parent as her root. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Even True Mother, born as the Only Begotten Daughter, cannot realize the ideal of True Parents alone. Only by the Only Begotten Daughter meeting the one who is to become the Messiah at the Second Coming and holding their Holy Wedding together can they advance to the position of True Parents. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"54\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Jesus, born as the Only Begotten Son 2,000 years ago, could understand and act upon Heaven\'s Will through his own experience and feelings without having been taught about God. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, born as the Only Begotten Daughter, also acted based on her own experiences and feelings while she was growing up, even without anyone teaching her. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"29\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter spent her growing period in communication with Heavenly Parent through the language of heart, which is the language of the heavenly kingdom. True Mother is the only daughter who has grown up knowing Heavenly Parent as her parent from birth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"48\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, perfected the heart of a child through a life of building an emotional bond of yearning for God that naturally flowed from deep within herself through the close communion of receiving Heavenly Parent\'s love and responding with filial piety. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"47\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, persistently built a bond of heart with Heavenly Parent through the giving and receiving of love and filial piety for 17 years before it was time for her to participate in the Holy Wedding. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"42\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, could advance to the Holy Wedding through her own judgment and determination, having truly experienced receiving love with the heart of a child. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, is Holy Mother Han, the substantial embodiment of Heavenly Mother while she attends Heavenly Mother substantially. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Jesus said to Philip, who asked to be shown God, \\\"Whoever has seen me has seen the Father.\\\" In the era of Cheon Il Guk, for humankind, seeing True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, is the same as seeing Heavenly Mother. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"43\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Like Jesus, True Mother the Only Begotten Daughter, substantially reveals Heavenly Mother, and this is expressed through the name \\\"Holy Mother Han.\\\" \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"This current time is particularly the time to attend the substantial Heavenly Mother, embodied in Holy Mother Han. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"20\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The center of Cheon II Guk is not the father but the mother. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"14\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"If the era before Cheon Il Guk was centered on the father, as a male centered era, the era of Cheon Il Guk is an era centered on the mother who gives birth to life. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"37\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"People can only be reborn as children of the substantial Heavenly Mother by becoming one with Holy Mother Han who is one with Heavenly Mother. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"27\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When blessed families advance in unity with Holy Mother Han, True Father in the spirit world can fully exercise his power. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"23\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The name of True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, is not Holy Mother Moon but Holy Mother Han. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"20\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Holy Mother Han is a name that contains within it \\\"Holy\\\" meaning sacred and divine, \\\"Mother\\\" who gives birth to life, and \\\"Han\\\", the surname of True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"34\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Holy Mother Han is a name used only by True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter. Holy Mother Han is True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter and the Substantial Holy Spirit. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"32\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The era for completing the providence of Cheon Il Guk is the era when True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter and Substantial Holy Spirit, appears as Holy Mother Han. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"31\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Holy Mother Han is the Mother of Peace, the Mother of the Universe. Therefore, wherever people unite with Holy Mother Han, the completion of the providence and the realization of a peaceful world become possible. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"37\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Only Begotten Daughter True Mother is the only one who has revealed the truth of Heaven\'s providence to humankind. She revealed the truth of the providence by revealing the essence of Heavenly Parent, the essence of Jesus, and the essence of Christianity. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"44\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother revealed God as our Heavenly Parent and illuminated the truth of the providence using a title from the secret language of Heaven, \\\"Only Begotten Daughter.\\\" \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"29\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Now \\\"Holy Mother Han,\\\" as True Mother\'s new name, clearly reveals the identity of the substantial Heavenly Mother to the whole world. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"While Holy Mother Han remains on this earth, all humankind on earth should come to know Holy Mother Han. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"21\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Now is the time to receive cooperation from the spirit world by earnestly connecting to Heaven so that Holy Mother Han can be clearly revealed in the history of humankind. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"32\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, is the central pillar for completing the providence of Cheon Il Guk. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"19\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"From the time that Jesus, who came as the Only Begotten Son, said \\\"I will come again,\\\" the focal point of Heaven\'s providence has been to give birth to the Only Begotten Daughter. This is because only with the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter could the meaning of \\\"I will come again\\\", namely, the Marriage Supper of the Lamb and the realization of the ideal of True Parents become possible. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"73\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In 2010, True Parents declared the complete unity of True Parents with Heavenly Parent. After True Father\'s Cheonju Seonghwa in 2012, True Mother declared “advancement without pause\\\" and proclaimed the Foundation Day of Cheon Il Guk in 2013. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"40\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, is the only one who can realize Heavenly Parent\'s dream on earth and is the central pillar for completing the providence of Cheon Il Guk, working in complete unity with Heavenly Parent and True Father. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"43\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Blessed families have the responsibility to realize the ideal world following the original plan of creation that Heavenly Parent has longed to see fulfilled, by attending the Only Begotten Daughter, True Mother, who has opened the era to bring an end to conflict, violence and war, and to firmly settle the nation of love and peace, Cheon Il Guk. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"61\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother understood the essence of Heaven\'s providence. As the date of the Holy Wedding approached, although it was not easy for her to take on the responsibility alone at the young age of 17, she knew, “Without me, Heavenly Parent has no one to rely on.\\\" True Mother, feeling Heavenly Parent\'s heart asking her, \\\"Please help me,\\\" made her own judgment and determination, declaring \\\"I will do it!\\\" and decided to participate in the Holy Wedding. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"79\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Understanding the desperate circumstances in which the Holy Wedding, the date for which Heavenly Parent had already set, could not be delayed any further, True Mother steeled herself, saying \\\"I will give up everything! I will think only of Heavenly Parent!\\\" \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"43\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When bidding farewell to True Father before his holy body as he ascended to the heavenly realm on September 14, 2012, True Mother renewed her determination with these words:Father, you are now safely arriving in the Heavenly Cheon Jeong Gung. I will settle Cheon Il Guk on this earth before the end of my life. I know that Heavenly Father will help us. Please do not worry. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"69\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"As True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, continued her unceasing progress, it was only Heavenly Parent who was her pillar of fire and pillar of cloud. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"28\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent silently wept seeing True Mother when she wanted to give up because it was too difficult, and True Mother pressed forward for Heavenly Parent because she knew too well Heavenly Parent\'s hope, circumstances, and heart, as expressed in those silent tears. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"45\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother hopes that the blessed families as the chosen people will become the sons and daughters of Heaven whom True Father can greet, saying \\\"Ah, you\'ve come! Welcome!\\\" when they go to the spirit world after fulfilling their God-given responsibilities during their time on earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"48\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents are the Messiahs and Saviors who give rebirth to fallen humankind as Heavenly Parent\'s sons and daughters through the Marriage Blessing. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Jesus was conceived and born as Heavenly Parent\'s Only Begotten Son. However, because Mary who gave birth to Jesus, Zechariah\'s family, the religious leaders, and the people did not believe in Jesus, the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter was thwarted, and Jesus went to the cross. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"49\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Zechariah\'s family and Mary were the very ones who conceived and gave birth to Jesus, in accordance with the revelation they received from God. Therefore, from the time Jesus was born, they should have believed in, protected, and attended him as God\'s son. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"45\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Jesus prophesied to his disciples that when the time came he would return and hold the Marriage Supper of the Lamb. This means that the one who would inherit Jesus\' mission and become the Messiah at the Second Coming would attain the position of the True Parents through the Holy Wedding with the Only Begotten Daughter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"59\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Although Jesus died before he was able to complete his mission to become the True Father, he successfully completed his growth to maturity through the growing period as described in the original process of creation. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"37\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"According to the principles of creation, in the history of humanity, Heavenly Parent creates only one man and one woman as the first ancestors of humankind. Therefore, the return of Jesus does not occur through the birth of another Only Begotten Son. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"43\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When Adam fell, he lost his qualification to be the Only Begotten Son. However, the Only Begotten Son Jesus, who died on the cross, maintained the victorious foundation he had achieved through his 33 years of life on earth. Therefore, no other Only Begotten Son will be born after Jesus. Instead, the completion of Jesus\' mission is accomplished through the one who inherits his foundation of victory. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"70\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Messiah at the Second Coming is the one who inherits the victorious foundation established by Jesus and completes Jesus\' mission to accede to the position of True Parents. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"31\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The one who inherited Jesus\' mission must complete the ideal of True Parents, which was both Jesus\' hope and mission, by participating in the Holy Wedding with the Only Begotten Daughter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"33\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The one who inherited Jesus\' mission comes on the victorious foundation of the fundamental providence of God\'s side up to the time of Jesus. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"26\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Jesus\' life and will find the bride that Jesus could not find. Together they become the True Parents to save all humankind. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent had Jesus return among the chosen Korean people where the Only Begotten Daughter is born. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"19\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent selected the Korean people centered on the Korean Han dynasty as the new chosen people to whom the Only Begotten Daughter would be sent. It is to them that Heavenly Parent sent the Only Begotten Daughter and enabled the Second Coming of Jesus. Therefore, the Messiah at the Second Coming also appeared among the chosen Korean people. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"62\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent chose one person among the chosen Korean people to inherit Jesus\' messianic mission. Since Jesus had already gone to the spirit world, he could not take on a physical body again. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"35\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Among the chosen Korean people, Heavenly Parent called and chose a person who was a descendant of ancestors with many good accomplishments, had the heavenly character capable of fulfilling the mission of the Messiah at the Second Coming, possessed the necessary acquired conditions, and was prepared at the time and place required for Heavenly Parent\'s providence. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"58\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The one who inherited Jesus\' mission had to walk the path of responsibility to first create the environment and foundation to become the True Father and then to receive the Only Begotten Daughter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"35\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The primary purpose of the one who will become the Messiah at the Second Coming is precisely to celebrate the Marriage Supper of the Lamb with the Only Begotten Daughter whom Heavenly Parent has sent and together become the True Parents of humankind. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"45\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent confirmed that the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter would come through the marriage of Daemo nim and Daebu nim, which took place on March 5, 1934. On April 17, 1935, Heavenly Parent called the one who would become the Messiah at the Second Coming. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"49\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Among the chosen Korean people, Heavenly Parent chose Moon Sun-myung, True Father, from the Nampyeong Moon clan that had many righteous accomplishments, to inherit the victorious foundations that Jesus had achieved by successfully reaching maturity, and to take on Jesus\' remaining mission of assuming the position of True Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"50\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Moon Sun-myung walked the responsible course to seek out the truth, establish a foundation of support among Korean Christianity, and establish a national foundation in Korea to receive the Only Begotten Daughter. By meeting True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, and participating with her in the Marriage Supper of the Lamb he acceded to the position of True Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"61\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In Heavenly Parent\'s providence, the True Parents are the true ancestors of humankind and the embodiment of Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"21\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Although Jesus is Heavenly Parent\'s Only Begotten Son, after the one who inherits his messianic mission holds the Holy Marriage with Heavenly Parent\'s Only Begotten Daughter and together they become the True Parents of humankind, Jesus works in cooperation with the True Parents for the providence of salvation. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"49\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After True Father\'s Cheonju Seonghwa in 2012, True Mother proclaimed Foundation Day on earth in 2013 and opened Cheon Il Guk. Since then, True Mother on earth has been carrying out the providence of Cheon Il Guk together with True Father in the heavenly realms. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"46\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father Sun Myung Moon was born on 1.6(6th day of 1st month) by the lunar calendar in 1920, in Jeongju, North Pyongan Province (now North Korea), to his father, Moon Gyeong-yu Chung-bu nim, and his mother, Kim Gyeonggye Chung-mo nim. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"43\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father Sun Myung Moon family was Confucian, but because the Messiah at the Second Coming must appear on a Christian foundation, Heavenly Parent guided True Father\'s family to convert to Christianity and led True Father to become a devout Christian. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"43\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \" As dawn broke on April 17, 1935, Jesus appeared in the spirit before True Father, then 15 years old, after he had prayed all night on Myodu Mountain. In fear and deep emotion, True Father saw Jesus\' sorrowful face and clearly heard his voice. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"47\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Jesus asked True Father to take on and fulfill the mission that he had been unable to complete. True Father refused several times, but after deeply sympathizing with Heavenly Parent\'s indescribable sorrow and pain, he finally accepted Jesus\' mission. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"41\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Jesus revealed to True Father Sun Myung Moon profound and remarkable truths about Heavenly Parent\'s providence, showed him the spirit world, and taught him about the providential tasks that lay ahead. Thus, in accordance with Heavenly Parent\'s Will, Jesus\' messianic mission passed to True Father. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"47\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father, who received Heavenly Parent\'s divine mandate, participated in the Holy Wedding with the Only Begotten Daughter and together they became the True Parents. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"27\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father after accepted Jesus\' mission, had to fulfill certain qualifications based on the principles of creation and prepare the environment and foundation centered on Christianity to receive the Only Begotten Daughter sent by Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"38\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Fathere had to discover and reveal the truth that Jesus could not reveal due to the disbelief of the people. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Fathere had to create a foundation within Christianity, a community of faith that could welcome the Only Begotten Daughter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"23\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Fathere had to establish a national foundation of support in Korea upon which the Marriage Supper of the Lamb could be held. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"26\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent and Jesus taught True Father the core of the truth. On that foundation, True Father investigated the truth of life, the universe, and history through dialogue with Heavenly Parent and Jesus while communicating with the spirit world. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"42\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"By reading and studying the Bible countless times, True Father discovered the providential secrets contained therein. He found that the Bible contained the concentrated essence of Heavenly Parent\'s providence of salvation, namely the providence of restoration. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"39\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After grasping the realities of heaven and earth, True Father systematized the truth. He revealed Heavenly Parent\'s heart, the purpose of creation, the Fall of our first ancestors, the history of Heavenly Parent\'s providence of restoration, and the essence of Jesus. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"44\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The core truth that True Father discovered was that the relationship between the Creator and human beings is that of parent and child. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father revealed that we were created as Heavenly Parent\'s beloved children, but due to their fall, Heavenly Parent became a sorrowful parent whose children have been lost. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"31\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"e Father revealed that Heavenly Parent sent the Only Begotten Son Jesus to carry out the providence of restoration, but because he was unjustly crucified due to the disbelief of the people, he must return to assume the position of True Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"44\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father after receiving Heavenly Parent\'s stamp of approval on the truth he had uncovered, he first practiced it himself and then began proclaiming it to both the earthly and heavenly realms. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"36\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father compiled the truths he discovered into Wolli Wonbon原理原本, The Original Text of the Divine Principle Teachings. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"21\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father began writing Wolli Wonbon(The Original Text of Divine Principle) on May 11, 1951 and completed it on May 10, 1952. True Father had his disciples publish Wolli Haeseol(原理解释), An Explanation of the Divine Principle, in 1957, which elaborated on Wolli Wonbon. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"44\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father by investigating and explaining the truth in Wolli Wonbon(原理原本 Original Text of Divine Principle), he fulfilled his mission of revealing the truth, which was part of the foundation for welcoming God\'s Only Begotten Daughter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"39\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Wolli Wonbon(原理原本 Original Text of Divine Principle), Wolli Haeseol(原理解释, Explanation of the Divine Principle) and Wolli Gangron(原理講論, Exposition of the Divine Principle) describe the providence only up to the time of True Parents\' advent, and do not include the reality of True Parents and their providential course. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"49\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \" Wolli Wonbon(原理原本 Original Text of Divine Principle) contents and other revised text are organized around God the Father, Jesus, the Only Begotten Son and the Messiah at the Second Coming. There is no mention of the truth and providence centered around God\'s Only Begotten Daughter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"48\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In order to grasp the entirety of the truth and providence of Heavenly Parent, blessed families must study to understand the actual lives and teachings of True Parents, especially the Cheon Il Guk teachings revealed by God\'s Only Begotten Daughter, True Mother, during the Cheon Il Guk era. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"50\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father had the mission to create a foundation within Christianity to welcome the Only Begotten Daughter. Considering Jesus\' hopes, this was the key mission that True Father, who had inherited the mission of Jesus, the Only Begotten Son, had to fulfill. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"44\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Christianity needed to prepare for the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter who would participate in the Marriage Supper of the Lamb, which was Jesus\' unfulfilled hope. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"29\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father, who inherited Jesus\' mission, had to create an environment where Korean Christianity centered on Jesus could welcome and attend the Only Begotten Daughter in the position of True Mother. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"35\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"During Japanese oppression in Korea, several Spirit-led Christian groups emerged who had received the revelation that Jesus would return in the flesh. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"During Japanese oppression in Korea, several Spirit-led Christian groups emerged. They were the foundation in Korean Christianity that Heaven had specially prepared for the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter, God\'s calling of the Messiah at the Second Coming, and the appearance of the True Parents. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"47\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father first revealed the providence to the prepared Spirit-led groups, they could not accept True Father and his teachings. Next, True Father introduced Heavenly Parent\'s providence to the Abel-type Christian groups who had refused to bow at Shinto shrines, and to mainstream institutional Christianity, but they too disbelieved and even persecuted True Father. In response, True Father founded the Holy Spirit Association for the Unification of World Christianity in 1954. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"73\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When the one who is to become the Messiah at the Second Coming appears, Christianity must follow him and provide the environment to welcome the Only Begotten Daughter, and at the same time establish the foundation for the Marriage Supper of the Lamb, the Holy Wedding of the Only Begotten Daughter and the Messiah at the Second Coming. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"60\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father, who inherited Jesus\' mission, understood this essence of Christianity and worked to awaken Christianity to provide that foundation. However, because Christianity ultimately did not believe in True Father, it became difficult for True Father to establish such an environment within Christianity. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"45\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In order to fulfill Jesus\' hopes, True Father needed a providential foundation that could welcome the Only Begotten Daughter. Thus, while working alone to overcome this dark situation, True Father had to establish a foundation to substitute for Christianity. That was the Holy Spirit Association for the Unification of World Christianity. However, that foundation was still small and weak when compared to Christianity, and received severe Christian opposition and persecution. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"72\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Only Begotten Daughter, True Mother, and the Returning Messiah, True Father, began the course of the providence of salvation in a difficult environment where Christianity opposed them. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"From the viewpoint of Heavenly Parent\'s providence, the position of True Parents must be recognized at least on a national basis. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"23\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"For the Returning Messiah to meet the Only Begotten Daughter and for them to hold the Marriage Supper of the Lamb, a foundation was needed where the Korean people as the chosen people could welcome the Only Begotten Daughter and attend True Parents at the national level. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"49\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent prepared in advance so that True Father could establish a national foundation. After Korea\'s liberation from Japan, many key figures in the Korean government were Christians. If True Father had been able to create a foundation to be welcomed by Christianity, the circumstances would have been created whereby a connection between True Father and the Korean government could have been established. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"65\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Due to Christian disbelief and persecution, True Father faced great difficulties in creating the environment in which Korea could welcome the Only Begotten Daughter and True Parents at the national level centered on Christianity. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"35\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father sought to establish a condition of creating a national foundation by sending Korean missionaries from the Holy Spirit Association for the Unification of World Christianity to the providentially important nations of Japan and the United States. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"40\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father sent Missionary Choi Sang-ik to Japan in 1958, and Missionaries Kim Young-oon and David S.C. Kim (Kim Sang-cheol) to America in 1959. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"26\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Holy Wedding of True Parents took place amid Christian and Korean government persecution of True Father and the Unification Church. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"23\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"On the 16th day of the 3rd lunar month of 1960, as Heavenly Parent planned, the Returning Messiah and the Only Begotten Daughter participated in the Marriage Supper of the Lamb. Through this, they became the True Parents and throughout their lives they have brought many blessed families into existence. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"51\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Marriage Supper of the Lamb is the starting point at which True Parents appear and fulfill Heavenly Parent\'s dream. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"22\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent desired to live together with all of humankind through the True Parents in the kingdom of heaven on earth and in the eternal world. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"27\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"According to God\'s principles of creation, Adam and Eve, our first ancestors, were meant to grow to maturity independently and become the True Parents through the Holy Wedding. However, due to their self-centered desires, they fell and came under the lineage of Satan. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"44\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After the Fall, Heavenly Parent created new ancestors of humankind, the Only Begotten Son and Only Begotten Daughter, to fulfill the dream of creation. Therefore, the Only Begotten Son and Only Begotten Daughter, as the original ancestors of the creation, must grow to maturity independently to become the perfected True Parents. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"53\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents\' perfected family is to be the model perfected family of the original creation for all humankind. Thus, all humankind would grow and strive to fulfill the purpose of creation by following the example of the perfected family of True Parents. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"44\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father, who inherited Jesus\' messianic mission, had to grow to maturity as a pure man in accordance with God\'s principles of creation, join with the pure woman, the Only Begotten Daughter, and together through their Holy Wedding, become the True Parents whom Heavenly Parent had longed to see. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"51\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The hope of the one who inherited Jesus\' mission is to hold the Holy Wedding with the Only Begotten Daughter and that they together become the True Parents. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents appeared due to the determination of the Only Begotten Daughter. The Only Begotten Daughter, True Mother, understanding the circumstances of the Heavenly Parent, who could not extend the providence any longer, made her own determination to attend the Holy Wedding with True Father for the sake of Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"53\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Although all the circumstances were unfavorable for holding the Holy Wedding, the Only Begotten Daughter, True Mother, as the central pillar for the completion of Heavenly Parent\'s providence, determined to take responsibility for everything and absolutely fulfill Heavenly Parent\'s Will together with True Father. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"46\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In the Old Testament Age, Heavenly Parent guided the providence of restoration to sever the connection of lineage with Satan. On this foundation, Heavenly Parent sent Jesus, the Only Begotten Son, through which the providence of restoration of the Old Testament Age was completed and concluded. From that point on, in Heavenly Parent\'s providence of salvation, there was no longer a providence of restoration through indemnity of the same form as in the Old Testament Age. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"78\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The providence of restoration in the Old Testament Age was Heavenly Parent\'s providence to establish the foundation for the birth of the Only Begotten Son and Only Begotten Daughter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"31\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents bequeath Heavenly Parent\'s lineage to fallen human beings by giving them rebirth through the Blessing Ceremony. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"19\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The essence of rebirth, by which fallen lineage is converted to Heavenly Parent\'s lineage, is to be born again through the love of True Parents who are one with Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"33\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The course for True Father, who inherited the mission of Jesus, the Only Begotten Son, is to pass through the course of growth to maturity according to God\'s principles of creation, and participate with True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, in the Holy Wedding, together becoming the True Parents. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"51\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Through the Blessing Ceremony, True Parents give rebirth to fallen people as sons and daughters of Heavenly Parent\'s lineage through the true love of both True Mother and True Father. This is comparable to the situation the original ancestors would have been in had they not fallen. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"49\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Since the time of Jesus\' passing, the focus of Heavenly Parent\'s providence has been to give birth to and establish the Only Begotten Daughter of Heavenly Parent\'s direct lineage as the central pillar of the providence. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"38\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Today, after 2,000 years, in the era of the completion of the providence, True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, born for the first time in 6,000 years of biblical history, is the central pillar for the completion of the providence in Heavenly Parent\'s providential plan. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"47\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Until now, the work of the providence of restoration has proceeded centered on men. To correct this and establish the ideal world of creation, True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, must reveal Heavenly Mother to humankind and carry out the central role at the forefront to complete the work in the providence of restoration. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"57\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The 53 years from the Holy Wedding until Foundation Day were like a wilderness period. During these 53 years, True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, has always been the central pillar, and has been embracing everything in True Parents\' providence and participating in the providence internally, continuously working in complete oneness with Heavenly Parent. Through this, True Parents\' providence was victorious in the wilderness period and could advance to the Cheon Il Guk era. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"76\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After True Father\'s Cheonju Seonghwa True Mother proclaimed Foundation Day and is leading the Cheon Il Guk providence on earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"22\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In the Cheon II Guk era, True Mother brought to completion the four position foundation of True Parents\' family(Unity with Heavenly Parent, True Parents and 2 eldest children) in heaven and on earth by offering three years of memorial devotions for True Father before Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"48\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents, together with Heavenly Parent with whom they are completely one, are the True Parents of Heaven, Earth and Humankind. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"23\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother on earth is taking the lead in completing the providence of Cheon Il Guk, and True Father in the heavenly realm is always with True Mother on earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"32\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Now that True Mother, True Father, and Heavenly Parent are one, when all people become one with True Mother, they become one with True Father and one with Heavenly Parent and are therefore able to attain complete salvation, becoming filial sons and daughters and loyal patriots of Heaven as citizens of Cheon II Guk. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"56\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In the Cheon Il Guk era, True Father is the one who has completed Jesus\' unfulfilled hopes. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"19\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent gave birth to True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, among the chosen Korean people 2,000 years after the time of Jesus. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"25\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Through the Only Begotten Daughter\'s resolve, True Father participated together with True Mother in the Marriage Supper of the Lamb and they became the True Parents. True Father thus completed Jesus\' intended path. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"35\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In the Cheon Il Guk era, True Father is humankind\'s eternal True Father. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"15\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, is the eternal True Mother of humankind, and True Father is the eternal True Father of humankind. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"25\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In the Cheon Il Guk era, True Father is one who achieved oneness in love with Heavenly Father. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"20\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When True Parents achieve oneness with Heavenly Parent, together they become the True Parents of Heaven, Earth and Humankind. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"21\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In the Cheon Il Guk era, since True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, and True Father, the Messiah at the Second Coming, are the True Parents of Heaven, Earth and Humankind who are one with Heavenly Parent, the invisible Heavenly Parent assumes True Parents\' form. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"47\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father said, \\\"If you remove Heavenly Parent from my life, it cannot be explained.\\\" True Father\'s life, which he lived according to his words, was a life uniquely devoted to Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"35\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father always prioritized Heaven\'s feelings (Cheon-jeong) over human feelings (in-jeong). As he lived, he put his love for Heavenly Parent and humankind above even his love for his own children. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"33\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When Moon Heung-jin, True Parents\' second son, went to the spirit world as a sacrificial offering for God\'s providence in heaven and on earth, True Father prayed for the advancement of Heavenly Parent\'s providence and proclaimed the Day of the Victory of Love (Ae-seung Il 爱胜日). \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"49\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"To proclaim the Day of the Victory of Love, I could not think about this as the death of my son. You have to understand that with my son\'s body(Moon Heung-jin) beside me, I fought this battle for God\'s love. Rather than a mother or father thinking about their deceased son, I had to think about God\'s love. I had to think about the love that can overcome the realm of death. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"75\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father invested his utmost effort to restore a nation for Heavenly Parent, confessing that his hope was to find Heavenly Parent\'s homeland and live there even for just one day before going to the eternal world. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"39\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father said \\\"Should I not die in a nation that God can protect? If I don\'t live that way before I go, wouldn\'t my life be a miserable one? So before I die, I must find that nation and live there even for just one day.\\\" \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"48\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother knew True Father\'s desperate hope to restore Heavenly Parent\'s homeland, so in front of True Father\'s holy body after his Seonghwa, she firmly promised to establish Cheon Il Guk during her lifetime. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"38\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father in the heavenly realm hopes that the blessed families worldwide will unite with True Mother in absolute faith, absolute love, and absolute obedience, participate in the providence to firmly settle Cheon Il Guk that True Mother is administering, and establish a world where we attend and live together on earth with Heavenly Parent substantially. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"59\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Our Creator, the Heavenly Parent, had a dream of living together with perfected True Parents and all of humanity as the sons and daughters in the kingdom of heaven, both on earth and in the spirit world. True Parents have the responsibility to fulfill Heavenly Parent\'s dream. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"49\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The True Parents\' Holy Wedding, the Marriage Supper of the Lamb held at the original Cheongpa-dong headquarters church in Seoul on the 16th day of the 3rd lunar month in 1960, was an occasion for glory in heaven and the proclamation of the greatest gospel on earth. Heavenly Parent had anxiously waited for this day for 6,000 years (as recorded in the Bible). \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"65\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents\' marathon efforts to find a nation that could attend Heavenly Parent on earth continued until 2013. Shedding their tears and blood, they engaged in an indescribable struggle to embrace the world with the singular determination to find a nation for Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"46\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The blessed couples who received True Parents\' Blessing, and the blessed children of the second, third, and later generations born through these couples are \\\"Pure Water,\\\" of True Parents\' direct lineage. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"33\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents established the foundation for God\'s kingdom by raising numerous blessed families, starting from the 36 Couples in 1961, followed by the 72 Couples, 124 Couples, 430 Couples, 777 Couples, 1,800 Couples, 6,000 Couples, 6,500 Couples, 30,000 Couples, 360,000 Couples, 3.6 Million Couples, and many others blessed thereafter. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"51\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Despite the importance of their work in Korea, True Parents moved the headquarters of their global mission to America in December 1971 and established the World Mission Headquarters in New York, making the United States the central nation for the worldwide providence. Similar to the Roman Empire 2,000 years ago. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"52\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The providence that was conducted from the US was not just for America but was the providence to save the world. This meant making a victorious foundation in the United States and then expanding it across the world, and connecting that victorious global foundation to Korea, Heavenly Parent\'s homeland and hometown. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"53\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents dedicated themselves completely to establishing the foundation for world restoration centered on America. At that time, the world was drifting like a crippled ship that had lost its compass. While the waves of communism were surging strongly, the democratic world was unable to respond effectively. Young people in America and Europe were immersed in seeking new value systems while rejecting the existing order. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"67\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"From 1972 to 1974, True Parents devoted all their energy to awakening America, a Christian nation and the central nation of the democratic world, to its mission of attending Heavenly Parent by urging the American people to return to the country\'s founding spirit. Through \\\"Day of Hope\\\" speaking tours of 7 cities in 1972, 21 cities in 1973, and 40 cities in 1974, they spread their life-giving teachings in all 50 states of America. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"75\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"On the foundation of the 50-state speaking tour, True Parents held large-scale rallies at Madison Square Garden in New York in September 1974, Yankee Stadium in New York in June 1976, and the Washington Monument in September of the same year. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"43\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Through the featured speech, \\\"God\'s Will and America,” given at the Washington Monument Rally, True Parents proclaimed the philosophy of \\\"Godism\\\" to the 300,000 who had gathered. True Parents called for America to become a nation that would hold fast to and attend Heavenly Parent, saying that God was beginning to leave that nation. True Parents appealed to the youth of the democratic world, whose center is the United States, to participate in building God\'s kingdom. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"78\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Communism stands against Heavenly Parent\'s ideal of creation by promoting atheism and materialism. Because it denies Heavenly Parent\'s very existence, communism cannot exist in Heavenly Parent\'s kingdom. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"29\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents proclaimed \\\"Godism\\\" and developed Victory Over Communism (VOC) movement to embrace communism through subjugating it with Heavenly Parent\'s love and truth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"25\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Victory Over Communism theory, which True Parents developed, focused on countering atheism and materialism in order to realize the ideal of Cheon Il Guk on earth. Based on VOC theory, they extensively developed the VOC movement throughout the world including Korea, Japan, the United States, Europe, and South America. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"54\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents had Dr. Morton Kaplan arrange a conference in Geneva, Switzerland, in August 1985, the overall purpose of which was to herald the end of communism. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"29\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents meeting with Soviet president Mikhail Gorbachev in Moscow in April 1990 helped open the way to the dissolution of the Soviet communist system. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"27\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In November 1991, True Parents also created a turning point for reunification and peace on the Korean Peninsula. Putting their lives in God\'s hands, they visited North Korea and had a historic meeting with President Kim Il-sung, through which they prepared a foundation for Korean unification. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"49\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent permitted the appearance of numerous religions suited to the character of the various regions and cultures of the world. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"23\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The ultimate purpose that all religions pursue is the same. Religious leaders looking beyond their own faith seek a world of peace, viewing the world as one community beyond national borders. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"32\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In 1991, True Parents published World Scripture: A Comparative Anthology of Sacred Texts, a compilation of religious scriptures arranged by core themes for comparative study. This initiative received much attention in religious circles. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"36\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In 2017, True Mother established the Interreligious Association for Peace and Development (IAPD) and is leading the global interreligious peace movement to produce substantial fruit. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"28\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"All religions must ultimately meet True Parents. Only by meeting True Parents can they bear the true fruits of peace they have pursued. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"27\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"With the advent of True Parents, all religions have reached their destination at the end of their journey. At this final destination, they must come to fully understand the existence of Heavenly Parent, who has been nurturing the goodness in the roots of each religion and receive True Parents\' Blessing. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"51\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In 1992 True Parents officiated a Blessing for 1,267 married couples with more than 40 Muslim couples, including the Grand Mufti of Yemen, and Muslim clergy and faithful from Jordan, Sudan, Syria, Senegal, Egypt, Turkey and Pakistan. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"41\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In 2001 True Parents officiated a Blessing under the banner \\\"International Marriage Blessing of 60 Religious Leaders,\\\" with interreligious leaders and their spouses, including Roman Catholic Archbishop Emmanuel Milingo. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"33\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In April 2002, True Parents officiated an Interreligious Clergy Blessing with 144,000 US clergy couples, and a Blessing and Rededication Ceremony in July 2002 with 1.8 million interreligious and international couples. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"33\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents conducted world speaking tours to bless the people of the world and directly teach them about life as citizens of heaven. True Parents poured out their unconditional parental love on their worldwide family, blessing the people of the world and preparing them as citizens of Cheon Il Guk so that the sovereignty of Heavenly Parent could spread across the globe and expand the foundation for the settlement of Cheon Il Guk. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"76\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Following the establishment of the Women\'s Federation for World Peace (WFWP) in 1992, True Mother began making international speaking tours and has spoken at more than 1,500 events worldwide. Notable speeches include those at the Tokyo Dome in Japan in September 1992, at the US Congress in July 1993, at the UN Headquarters in New York in September 1993, at the Korean National Assembly in October that year, and speeches at the Kremlin Palace in Russia and the Great Hall of the People in China. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"87\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After True Mother\'s speech to Congress, from 1994 the fourth Sunday of July each year has been designated as \\\"National Parents\' Day\\\" in the United States. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After establishing the Universal Peace Federation (UPF) in New York in September 2005, True Parents conducted three world tours to introduce it internationally. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"25\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"From September to December 23, 2005, True Parents conducted world tours for the inauguration of national Universal Peace Federation (UPF) chapters in 120 nations. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"26\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"From April 28 to August 20, 2006, True Parents conducted world tours for the inauguration of national Universal Peace Federation (UPF) covering 180 nations. Members of the True Family participated in delivering True Parents\' message and officiating Blessing Ceremonies, thus enabling two generations of the True Family to achieve victory together. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"53\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"From August 31 to October 14, 2006, the world tours for the inauguration of national Universal Peace Federation (UPF)—not only True Parents and True Children but also True Grandchildren participated—with three generations of the True Family touring 480 cities in 40 nations (12 cities in each) to bestow God\'s Word and the Marriage Blessing. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"56\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"During True Parents world tours to conduct speeches, they followed an intense schedule, traveling to a different country each day. At high-altitude locations in South America they kept oxygen tanks beside them as they delivered their speech. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"39\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents emphasize conservation of the environment as part of the responsibility of citizens of the kingdom of heaven on earth in attendance to Heavenly Parent. They emphasize that we must both preserve our planet\'s beautiful natural environment, which our Heavenly Parent created, and pioneer the creation of new environments ourselves. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"53\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"It is the responsibility of blessed families today to restore the environment to the pristine state of the original ideal of creation. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \" True Parents spent time going out to sea, presenting an ocean vision and making significant investments in developing a marine culture. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents established central bases for the ocean providence at Yeosu and Geomun Island in Korea, and Alaska and Hawaii in the United States, trained capable individuals through the rigors of ocean fishing and proposed plans for marine resource development. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"42\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents sought to help developing nations suffering from the problem of hunger by working to develop high-protein fishmeal using fish and krill, aiming to curtail humanity\'s food shortage problems. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"32\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \" In 2015, True Mother established the Sunhak Peace Prize to build a comprehensive vision for future environmental conservation and peace on Earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"25\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"By awarding individuals and organizations who contribute to creating harmony between humankind and the natural world, the Sunhak Peace Prize helps to protect the global environment and to awaken respect and love for humankind. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"37\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Sunhak Peace Prize brings to fruition the ideal of Cheon Il Guk where God, human beings, and all creation live together in harmony. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"27\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The work for the creation of the peaceful environment that True Parents have made their focus is developing as a movement to build a peaceful world—one global family of humankind— across various sectors of society including politics, religion, economics, culture and the arts, media, and academia, based on the principles of interdependence, mutual prosperity, and universal values. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"59\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents\' efforts for peace in several spheres bore fruit with the 2005 founding of the Universal Peace Federation (UPF), which works in a wide arena with the aim of realizing a peaceful world. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"37\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Universal Peace Federation (UPF) gained General Consultative Status at the UN Economic and Social Council and has succeeded in renewing after its founding, that status each time. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"29\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"With a presence in 194 countries, Universal Peace Federation (UPF) international peace efforts include collaboration with representatives in the fields of politics, economics, religion, media, academia, and culture. All of this work contributes to building a strong base for the realization of God\'s kingdom. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"48\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Before celebrating Foundation Day, True Parents prepared the foundation for the \\\"Holy Wedding of the True Parents of Heaven, Earth and Humankind\\\" at the \\\"Enthronement of the True Parents of Heaven, Earth and Humankind of Cheon Il Guk\\\" in 2013 through two Holy Weddings (1960 and 2003) and three Golden Wedding Anniversaries (2009, 2010 and 2012). \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"57\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \" True Parents first conducted a number of coronation and enthronement ceremonies, one of them was the Enthronement Ceremony for God\'s Kingship in 2001. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"26\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The first group of Blessing Ceremonies held after True Parents\' Holy Wedding in 1960 were church-level and national-level Blessings. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"22\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \" The Enthronement Ceremony of the Parent of the Cosmos and the Parents of Heaven and Earth Who Reign over the Blessed Families as the King and Queen of Peace and Unity was conducted in 2003. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"38\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Blessing Ceremonies held after the \\\"Holy Marriage Blessing of the Parents of Heaven and Earth Opening the Gates to Cheon Il Guk,\\\" in 2003 were world-level and heaven-and-earth-level Blessings. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"32\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After True Father\'s Cheonju Seonghwa in 2012, True Mother declared “advancement without pause” and as she opened Cheon Il Guk in 2013, she proclaimed the founding year of Cheon Il Guk.” \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"34\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Cheon Il Guk is short for the \\\"Cosmic [Heaven and Earth] Nation of Peace and Unity (Cheon-ju Pyeonghwa Tong-il Guk)\\\" \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"22\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Cheon Il Guk is a nation that begins when two people become one. It is the first nation in history to be founded on the basis of Heavenly Parent and True Parents becoming one. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"37\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Cheon Il Guk, beginning from the unity of Heavenly Parent and True Parents, then expands through the stages of the family, tribe, nation, world, and cosmos (heaven and earth) as it connects with the day-to-day lives of the Cheon Il Guk citizens. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"44\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The gates of Cheon Il Guk were opened on the 13th day of the 1st month by the heavenly calendar in 2013, Cheon Il Guk Foundation Day. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Life in the kingdom of heaven on earth becomes a substantial reality when the True Parents of Heaven, Earth and Humankind and their children live together as one in this new nation called Cheon Il Guk. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"38\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Cheon Il Guk Foundation Day is the day when Heavenly Parent\'s purpose of creation is completed. Heavenly Parent\'s purpose of creation is for Heavenly Parent to become one with True Parents and to live together. When Heavenly Parent and True Parents become one, the central point of heaven and earth for the completion of the purpose of creation appears. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"60\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The central point of heaven and earth that has manifested through Foundation Day is where God feels eternal stimulating joy and is the center of truth established through the embodiment of the Word. It is at this central point where the True Parents of Heaven, Earth and Humankind give rebirth to the blessed families and all of humanity as sons and daughters embodying the original standard of the Creation. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"71\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Cheon Il Guk Foundation Day was a blessed day when the blessed families could be reborn as Cheon Il Guk citizens in the restored Garden of Eden. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"27\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Cheon Il Guk Foundation Day is the founding day for blessed families to be registered as citizens of Cheon Il Guk. Blessed family members could be reborn as people of the original standard of creation not because they have fulfilled their responsibilities, but through the infinite grace of the True Parents of Heaven, Earth and Humankind. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"58\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Cheon Il Guk Foundation Day could be proclaimed because True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, was here on earth in the flesh to make the proclamation. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"27\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother has said that if blessed families understand the providential meaning of Cheon Il Guk Foundation Day they will be infinitely grateful in front of Heaven. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"For True Parents to attend Heavenly Parent on earth, it was necessary to have a foundation of national restoration centered on a foundation within Christianity. However, since the national foundation to attend Heavenly Parent on earth was not established, Heavenly Parent could not begin the earthly providence in unity with True Parents on earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"56\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The 53 years from 1960, when True Parents\' Holy Wedding was held, to Foundation Day in 2013, was the providence of searching for a nation with a strong Christian foundation so that people might attend Heavenly Parent on earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"41\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents\' marathon in search of a nation that could attend Heavenly Parent on earth continued until Foundation Day in 2013. They worked tirelessly to embrace the world with the sole thought of restoring a nation. Words cannot describe the battle they fought with their tears and blood. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"51\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Just under six months before Cheon Il Guk Foundation Day, True Father ascended to the spirit world, but Heavenly Parent asked True Mother to proceed as planned and proclaim Cheon Il Guk Foundation Day. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"35\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Just under six months before Cheon Il Guk Foundation Day, True Father ascended to the spirit world, but Heavenly Parent asked True Mother to proceed as planned and proclaim Cheon Il Guk Foundation Day. Knowing Heavenly Parent\'s heart, situation and hopes, True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, determined to obey Heaven\'s command and accordingly she proclaimed Foundation Day and the founding year of Cheon Il Guk. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"68\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother restored the name \\\"Heavenly Parent” to God and changed the title \\\"tribal messiah\\\" to \\\"heavenly tribal messiah” in accordance with the progress of the providence. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"28\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother promulgated the Cheon Il Guk Constitution, initiating the formation of the constitutional structure of Cheon Il Guk. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"20\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"For the eternal future of Cheon Il Guk, True Mother has advanced the providence by setting up three central strategies for Cheon Il Guk: witnessing, creating environments for witnessing, and cultivating capable young people. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"36\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother established the Universal Peace Academy (UPA) to cultivate young leaders for the eternal future of Cheon Il Guk and, using the proceeds from the sale of True Parents\' helicopter, she established the Wonmo Pyeongae Foundation to provide scholarship funding for the younger generation. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"47\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"For the first three years after True Father\'s Seonghwa, every day True Mother offered memorial devotions at Father\'s tomb, establishing an internal foundation of deep unity. For those three years, True Mother prayed to ask Heavenly Parent for compassion, forgiveness, and love for True Father. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"48\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father\'s mission should have been completed on earth, but as he had been unable to conclude his work before his Seonghwa, True Mother offered memorial devotions for True Father over the course of three years. At the third anniversary of True Father\'s Seonghwa, which marked the conclusion of the three-year period of memorial devotions, True Mother entreated Heaven that True Father could be liberated as being worthy of Heaven\'s praise, and she promised, \\\"I will take responsibility here on earth.\\\" \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"82\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother promised \\\"I will take responsibility here on earth.\\\" Father, please do not worry from now on. We will fulfill our responsibilities without fail. Therefore, Father, in the eternal Garden of the Original Homeland (Bonhyang Won本鄉苑), we pray that you will comfort our Heavenly Parent who has been lonely, and that you will be set free as the recipient of God\'s praise. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"65\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"At the conclusion of these three years of memorial devotions, True Mother declared that, centered on Hyo-jin nim\'s family and Heung-jin nim\'s family, True Parents\' family had completed their four-position foundation in heaven and on earth. She instructed that Hyo-jin nim\'s portrait be displayed in Jeongshim Won (now Cheonshim Won), so that members can attend Hyo-jin nim along with True Parents, Daemo nim and Heung-jin nim, and she said that Hyo-jin nim and Heung-jin nim were united as restored first and second born sons. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"87\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"From the 3rd anniversary of Father\'s Seonghwa, when True Parents\' family completed the four position foundation in heaven and on earth, True Mother introduced the concept of “hyojeong\\\" [filial heart]. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"33\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In the original Garden of Eden, Adam and Eve were supposed to become absolute counterparts of Heavenly Parent\'s heart. To do so, they had to perfect themselves and their family. The way for Adam and Eve to become absolute counterparts of Heavenly Parent\'s heart is through hyojeong, offering filial heart for Heaven. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"55\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Finally, through True Mother\'s three years of memorial devotions at True Father\'s tomb, True Parents completed the four-position foundation in heaven and on earth and became the complete counterparts to Heavenly Parent\'s heart (shimjeong). Thus, True Parents fully experienced the heart of Heavenly Parent, who is our parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"50\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents introduced the concept of “hyojeong” (filial heart) to humankind so that by practicing hyojeong, all people could receive the Blessing and become the perfect counterparts of Heavenly Parent\'s heart. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"33\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"What happens when we experience Heavenly Parent\'s heart through our practice of filial love (hyojeong)? When Heavenly Parent\'s heart of love, filled with a natural longing flowing from deep within, encounters humanity\'s filial love at the central point of heaven and earth, an explosion of heart occurs. When this happens, one feels the thrill of true love. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"60\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \".After ushering in Cheon Il Guk Foundation Day, blessed families who were reborn in the restored Garden of Eden were invited to fulfill the mission of the heavenly tribal messiah. True Mother emphasized that being a “heavenly tribal messiah” is in the sense that he or she is a tribal messiah that attends the Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"59\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The heavenly tribal messiahs have the mission to complete the blessing of 430 families horizontally on earth and to vertically complete the Liberation and Blessing Ceremonies of 430 generations of ancestors, in eight distinct lines. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"37\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Absolute good spirits who have received the Blessing through the Ancestor Liberation and Blessing Ceremonies will primarily reside in the Hyojeong Won attended by their blessed family descendants and they will actively support the providential activities of their descendants. In principle. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"44\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When blessed families fulfill their tribal messiah mission, they can be reborn as people matching the original standard of creation and complete the path to perfection. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"29\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"What happens when the tribal messiah mission is completed? People\'s fallen nature is removed, and they are reborn as original human beings, able to fulfill their responsibility through their own realizations. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"34\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Blessed couples who have completed their heavenly tribal messiah mission enter the realm of the royal family of Cheon Il Guk. Moreover, they become Cheonbo couples, treasures of heaven registered in Cheonbo Won, and are honored as blessed couples who have achieved the Cheonbo standard for Cheon Il Guk citizenship. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"54\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In order for fallen people to be reborn and return to the restored Garden of Eden, they must pass through the door of True Parents\' Blessing. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"29\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Through the Blessing Ceremony, a person is brought from Satan\'s lineage to God\'s. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"15\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The core of the Blessing Ceremony is the Holy Wine Ceremony. The Holy Wine sets the condition of a contract between God, Satan, and True Parents. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"28\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When you drink holy wine, Satan must open the gates of hell and liberate you and God must open the gates of heaven and welcome you. So, when the Blessing is given at the global level, the gates of hell will automatically open. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"45\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"During the seven-year course after True Father\'s Cheonju Seonghwa, True Mother set the standard for the restoration of seven nations, seven religious orders, and a continent, and, almost miraculously, was able to proclaim the firm settlement of Cheon Il Guk. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"43\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The firm settlement of Cheon Il Guk was proclaimed on the 7th anniversary of Foundation Day in 2020. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"20\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The firm settlement of Cheon Il Guk begins with the emergence of the True Parents of Heaven, Earth, and Humankind—Heavenly Parent and True Parents in unity—and expands to all of humanity. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"32\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The firm settlement of Cheon Il Guk on earth means that God has been established as the vertical True Parent of humankind, our Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"27\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The proclamation of the firm settlement of Cheon Il Guk confirmed that Heavenly Parent could finally settle and dwell on earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"22\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The proclamation of the firm settlement of Cheon Il Guk confirmed that Heavenly Parent could finally settle and dwell on earth. When Heavenly Parent settled on earth, True Parents proclaimed Heavenly Parent\'s Holy Community and began a new providential course to embrace at least one-third of humanity as Heavenly Parent\'s children by 2027. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"55\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent\'s Holy Community is a new community that has never existed on earth before. In “Heavenly Parent\'s Holy Community,\\\" \\\"Heavenly Parent\\\" means the True Parents of Heaven, Earth and Humankind, and \\\"Holy Community\\\" means a sacred or holy gathering of people. So it is a community of people bound together by a common bond as sons and daughters of Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"64\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent\'s Holy Community is Heavenly Parent\'s great umbrella, one which is more than large enough to embrace both the spiritual and earthly worlds. It is a vast community that can bring together all people under one banner, no matter their political, religious, financial, or ideological background. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"49\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent\'s Holy Community also has the significance that the Heavenly Mother becomes the center and gives rebirth to humanity. True Mother is carrying out the mission of Heavenly Mother on earth. Within Heavenly Parent\'s Holy Community, True Mother gives rebirth to all people so that they can be registered to live in the restored Garden of Eden. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"61\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother embraces and gives birth to people at each stage of life, from old age to middle age, from middle age to young adult, from young adult to youth, and from youth to childhood. Through this, Mother gives us the qualification as sons and daughters through which Heavenly Parent can relate with all humankind on earth directly. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"59\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In March 2018, True Mother asked eight Cheon Il Guk leaders to offer special devotions (jeongseong) at Jeongshim Won every night for 21 days to create a spiritual foundation for the victorious firm settlement of Cheon Il Guk. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"41\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"On June 1, 2020, True Mother proclaimed a seven-month course and asked the leaders and members in Korea to join the ongoing special night devotions at Jeongshim Won. True Mother said that we should be able to command and mobilize the spirit world from Jeongshim Won. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"49\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \" On October 11, 2020, True Mother established Cheonshim Won as a providential organization, she designated it as a place to nurture second and third generation spiritual leaders for Cheon Il Guk. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"34\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Cheonshim Won天心苑 is the worldwide headquarters for jeongseong (devotions). It is the main sanctuary for jeongseong in Cheon Il Guk, the main headquarters for the spiritual providence, and the center for developing the spirituality of Cheon Il Guk leaders and blessed families. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"45\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Cheonshim Won is a place where blessed families can resonate with the heart of Heaven. It is a holy sanctuary where people can have direct dialogue with Heavenly Parent, much as Adam and Eve could. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"37\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father and True Mother are advancing the providence together in both the spiritual and physical worlds. As a couple who are the embodiment of Heavenly Parent, True Parents are the visible Heavenly Parent of Day, freely operating in both the spiritual and physical worlds, guiding the providence. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"50\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Cheonshim Won is a place where True Father carries out his works. Miracles occur when we unite with True Parents. By praying and offering jeongseong (devotions) at Cheonshim Won, we can find the insight and wisdom to solve our problems. This is the kind of spiritual foundation that has been prepared for us there. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"57\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Now we are in a time when the spirit world is operating with an automatic system, when your jeongseong offerings will automatically move those in the spirit world to act. This automatic system has been developed through a foundation of jeongseong built up over 21 years. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"48\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Cheonshim Won is a source of hope for everyone, the most precious gift, and the key to solving all problems. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"23\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When we are on the same frequency as Heavenly Parent and True Parents\' hearts, we experience resonance with them. When we achieve resonance in unity with Heavenly Parent and True Parents, we can hear their voices. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"38\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Through the Cheonshim Won providence we can feel that the era is approaching when we can live as perfected spiritual beings on earth, communicating with the spirit world through devotion and prayer. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"33\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When our hearts unite with the heart of Heaven through offering devotions at the special night vigil at Cheonshim Won, we can feel that we have reached the time for victory in witnessing to others and for the realization of a heavenly unified Korea. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"45\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"For national restoration, cooperation from the spirit world is absolutely essential. Cheonshim Won is where we offer devotions so that True Father can come from the spirit world to the earth to work for national restoration. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"37\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When we pray earnestly in absolute unity with True Mother, True Father comes to earth bringing the spirit world. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"21\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother asked us to witness on the foundation of jeongseong (devotions) at Cheonshim Won, and through this expand the foundation for national restoration. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"26\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Apostle Paul was a person who looked at the world from an intellectual viewpoint, but after being struck by a spiritual thunderbolt on the road to Damascus, he underwent a 180-degree conversion. He realized there is an explosive path you can take if you act according to your feelings rather than simply analyzing things logically. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"59\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In expanding the foundation for national restoration, like the Apostle Paul after his conversion, we must harmonize spirit and truth while standing at the center of both the spiritual and intellectual worlds. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"35\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent wanted to experience life in the kingdom of heaven on earth through True Parents, living in unity with Heavenly Parent\'s sons and daughters. For us to attend Heavenly Parent on earth, there must be a home, a dwelling place befitting of the Heavenly Parent. The Cheon Won Gung Cheonil Sanctum is this dwelling for Heavenly Parent on earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"63\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"During the 12 years since Foundation Day, True Mother, the substantial Holy Spirit and Only Begotten Daughter, has devoted her utmost sincerity and effort to create an environment in which people can attend and live with Heavenly Parent on earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"43\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Cheon Won Gung Cheonil Sanctum is the first home for Heavenly Parent to be built in 6,000 years of providential history. True Parents are building it in order that Heavenly Parent may be attended on earth. This is the palace that True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, has built for Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"54\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Cheon Won Gung Cheonil Sanctum is where Heavenly Parent and True Parents dwell together. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"19\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent and True Parents can be together in the Cheonil Sanctum because of True Parents\' sphere of victory in unity with Heavenly Parent, achieved for the first time in human history. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"35\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The groundbreaking ceremony for Cheon Won Gung was held in September 2017, and two years later, in July 2019, it was announced that Cheon Won Gung would serve as the Cheon Il Guk Central Administration where the True Parents of Heaven, Earth and Humankind can directly govern humanity with love. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"52\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In May 2020, marking the 60th anniversary of the True Parents\' Holy Wedding, the sanctuary for Heavenly Parent within Cheon Won Gung was named the \\\"Cheon Won Gung Cheonil Sanctum天苑宮天一聖殿.” \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"32\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Cheon Won Gung Cheonil Sanctum is a holy temple that True Parents built in order that people can attend Heavenly Parent on earth in the new era of creation that has dawned after 6,000 years. Heavenly Parent\'s entrance into the Cheonil Sanctum is the fulfillment of Heavenly Parent\'s dream of living in oneness with human beings, cherished from before the time of Creation. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"66\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Cheon Won Gung Cheonil Sanctum is a holy temple that True Parents built in order that people can attend Heavenly Parent on earth in the new era of creation that has dawned after 6,000 years. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"38\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \" Heavenly Parent\'s entrance into the Cheonil Sanctum is the fulfillment of Heavenly Parent\'s dream of living in oneness with human beings, cherished from before the time of Creation. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Cheon Won Gung Cheonil Sanctum becomes the central point of heaven and earth, the central point where Heavenly Parent, who is one with the True Parents, governs all humanity and all creation. It serves as the central point from which to guide all fields including religion, politics, economics, academia, media, the arts, and education. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"57\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Attending Heavenly Parent on earth for the first time in human history, True Mother dedicated the Cheonil Sanctum with tears of gratitude, joy, excitement, and deep emotion. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"29\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"With the holding of the Cheon Won Gung Cheonil Sanctum Entrance Ceremony in April 2025, an era fully opens up where Heavenly Parent, dwelling in the Cheon Won Gung Cheonil Sanctum, directly governs the citizens of Cheon Il Guk. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"41\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother said, \\\"Since I announced the Entrance Ceremony for the Cheon Won Gung Cheonil Sanctum, I cannot sleep. I feel so sorry before Heaven.\\\" \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"27\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"On the 70th (from 1954) anniversary of the founding of the Family Federation for World Peace and Unification in June 2024, ahead of the Cheon Won Gung Cheonil Sanctum Entrance Ceremony, True Parents announced Cheon Mu Won天務院 as a new organizational structure for Cheon Il Guk centered on Cheon Jeong Gung天正宮. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"53\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Cheon Mu Won is the Cheon Il Guk Central Administration, where True Parents work on earth in unity with Heavenly Parent as the True Parents of Heaven, Earth and Humankind. It is the central head-quarters that governs the world with the law of love. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"46\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Cheon Mu Won is an organization that can lead the nation as the government and cabinet of Cheon Il Guk. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"22\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Cheon Mu Won is the new organizational structure that True Parents established centered on Cheon Jeong Gung 天正宮, ahead of the Cheon Won Gung Cheonil Sanctum Entrance Ceremony. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The central axis of Cheon Mu Won is spirit and truth. True Parents have emphasized this axis of spirit and truth since the founding of the Family Federation for World Peace and Unification. “Spirit” and “truth\\\" refer to Cheonshim Won and mission work. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"45\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Cheon Mu Won establishes each department based on axis of spirit and truth. Each department of Cheon Mu Won assists True Parents in the various duties involved in governing Cheon Il Guk and they serve as Cheon II Guk\'s central administrative departments. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"44\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Cheon Mu Won is an organization for realizing a world of peace, one family of humankind centered on Heavenly Parent and True Parents. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"25\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Cheon Mu Won has the mission to teach and inform all humanity so that they know, attend and live day by day with Heavenly Parent. It also has the mission to move forward efficiently, in perfect order, as one system with True Mother, the Only Begotten Daughter, at the center so that a heavenly unified Korea and heavenly unified world can be realized substantially on earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"68\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Cheon Mu Won is a new providential organization directly governed by Heavenly Parent. It is the first of its kind, something that has never existed in the history of the fallen world. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"33\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The realization of a heavenly unified Korea is an urgent providence that blessed families must complete to accomplish the Cheon Il Guk ideal, a world of peace, one family of humankind centered on Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"37\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"At the 2019 national prayer meeting for Opening the Era of Heavenly Unified Korea, True Parents emphasized that Heavenly Parent must be the owner of a unified Korea. This nation must fulfill its responsibility as Heaven\'s chosen people. If this nation fails to fulfill its responsibilities, it will pay indemnity and drift away. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"55\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The progression to knowing and attending Heavenly Parent began with the announcement of \\\"Heavenly Japan\\\" at a 2017 Osaka rally. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"22\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In 2018, with the proclamation of \\\"Heavenly Korea” and the \\\"Heavenly United States,\\\" the providence to attend Heavenly Parent expanded to the continental level. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"26\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"A heavenly unified world means a global family community of humankind based on interdependence, mutual prosperity and universally shared values, with Heavenly Parent at the center. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"28\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The purpose of True Parents\' providence preparing for a heavenly unified world is to create the environment for a heavenly unified Korea. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The reason True Parents guided the global providence from the United States for some 40 years was to prepare the environment to fulfill the dream of a heavenly unified Korea. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"32\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In 2020, at the Special Gathering for the 60th Anniversary of True Parents\' Holy Wedding, True Mother announced Heavenly Parent\'s Holy Community, an expansive community where all people can gather under one flag centered on Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"39\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother emphasized that Holy Community must establish two pillars to realize the dream of \\\"One Family of Humankind under Heavenly Parent.\\\" Family Federation works toward the dream through the True Family Blessing movement and UPF works through the Heavenly Unification Movement centered on “Godism (Head-Wing Thought).” \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"49\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"To realize the peace vision of interdependence, mutual prosperity and universally shared values, True Mother has comprehensively developed transnational peace movements with world leaders centered on the Universal Peace Federation (UPF). \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"33\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"A world of peace with Heavenly Parent at the center cannot be established by political leaders alone, but also requires the involvement of religious leaders, who address the spiritual aspects of life, working together in harmony. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"38\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother inaugurated the Interreligious Association for Peace and Development (IAPD) in 2017, and has guided its activities so that religious leaders could pursue essential values beyond religious barriers and work toward the realization of lasting world peace. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"40\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent, in oneness with True Parents, is creating Heavenly Parent\'s Holy Community and reaching out to all people on earth. Those who receive Heavenly Parent\'s invitation can be reborn as Heavenly Parent\'s children by participating in Heavenly Parent\'s Holy Community. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"43\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father and True Mother are one. True Parents have achieved ultimate unity, reaching the place of oneness of heart, body, and mindset, and oneness in harmony. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"31\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother has worked to build a heavenly unified Korea and heavenly unified world centered on interdependence, mutual prosperity and universal values through the solidarity of business leaders, academics and media professionals. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"33\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"If True Father came to us at this moment, what would he say? True Father, who achieved final unity with True Mother, would urge us, “Become one with Mother! Attend Mother well!\\\" \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"33\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \" At the 20th Anniversary of the Founding of the Women\'s Federation for World Peace in 2012, True Father left what seemed like his last message for us: \\\"Let\'s live together!\\\" He said, \\\"Let\'s live together even if there\'s no food. Even if all we can do is draw pictures of the food we like and feast with our eyes, let\'s live together!\\\" \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"65\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Father\'s overwhelming desire was to live even one day attending Heavenly Parent in a heavenly unified Korea, in Heavenly Parent\'s homeland and hometown. Heaven is where the True Parents of Heaven, Earth and Humankind live together in loving harmony with their sons and daughters. - \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"49\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent\'s dream is living in the kingdom of heaven on earth in oneness with True Parents and their sons and daughters! True Parents\' dream is living together even for just one day in Cheon Il Guk! If we become sons and daughters who resolve to be discovered as the small needles who can help realize that dream, True Parents will send us a happy smile. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"68\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After the Fall, even though people have yearned for peace, they have been unable to realize that dream. This is because the world of peace and happiness that humanity has longed to see can only be fulfilled in a place where Heavenly Parent and True Parents are at the center, living together with humankind. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"56\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother the Only Begotten Daughter, grew up recognizing Heavenly Parent as her parent and, with absolute faith, absolute love, and absolute obedience, dedicated her life to fulfilling God\'s Will. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"32\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother through her own discernment and resolve, she participated in the Marriage Supper of the Lamb with the Returning Messiah and together they ascended to the position of True Parents. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"34\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \" In 1935, at the age of 15, True Father received his call from Heaven when Jesus appeared to him and earnestly asked him to fulfill the mission he had not been able to complete during his life on earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"41\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After True Father and True Mother held their Holy Wedding Holy, without a national-level foundation, True Parents had to persevere through a 53-year wilderness course. Until the establishment of Foundation Day in 2013, True Father and True Mother were providential companions in a prolonged wilderness era. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"47\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The book, The Value of True Parents in Heaven\'s Providence explains that True Mother, as the Only Begotten Daughter, born after 6,000 years of providential history, is the central pillar for the fulfillment of the providence that actualizes Heavenly Parent\'s dream. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"43\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"To cleanse humanity\'s fallen past and create a new history of peace, True Parents have together walked an unimaginable thorny path of blood, sweat, and tears. As the Mother and Father of Peace, their lives serve as the compass for all humankind, demonstrating the model of True Parents, True Teachers, and True Leaders. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"55\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother, attending Heavenly Parent as the substantial Holy Spirit, is opening the new age through a mother\'s love and sacrifice, tirelessly working to complete Heavenly Parent\'s providence. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent is a being of love. Likewise, the essence of True Parents, who embody Heavenly Parent, is also love. True Parents always respond to Heavenly Parent\'s love with filial piety, and have lived a life of hyojeong (filial heart) expressed through the sharing of love and filial heart. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"51\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents are the substantial embodiment of Heavenly Parent. True Parents have united with Heavenly Parent, together with whom they are the True Parents of Heaven, Earth and Humankind. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"31\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents, who are united with Heavenly Parent are the new creators who have given birth to Heaven\'s children. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"20\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent creates only one man and one woman. However, True Parents of Heaven, Earth, and Humankind can eternally expand the lineage of Heavenly Parent through their descendants. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents are the True Parents, True Teachers, and True Leaders of humankind. As True Parents they give rebirth to fallen humanity as Heaven\'s children. As True Teachers, they directly take responsibility for educating and nurturing Heaven\'s children. As True Leaders, they create the optimal environment for Heaven\'s children to grow. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"53\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents are the Parents of harmony, unity, peace, and happiness. As the Mother and Father of Peace, True Parents comfort and wipe away humanity\'s tears. True Parents are the parents of happiness who are creating the environment for living in the kingdom of heaven on earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"48\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents are the parents of harmony and unity who bring the people of the world into oneness as one family of brothers and sisters. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"28\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents are re-creating the original Garden of Eden and original homeland in Hyojeong Cheonwon, which is a model for the kingdom of heaven on earth beyond the restoration of Eden. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"33\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents are our Wang Omma and Wang Appa. Wang Omma is the best mother among all mothers, and Wang Appa is the best father among all fathers. True Mother is the Wang Omma, the Mother of the whole universe, and True Father is the Wang Appa, the Father of the whole universe. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"54\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents are the Wang Omma and Wang Appa who embrace everyone equally as Heaven\'s children, regardless of religion, country, race, livelihood, or gender. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"25\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents are our Wang Omma and Wang Appa that create an environment where blessed children can harmonize and communicate with and report to Heavenly Parent every day, expressing greater and greater gratitude, living in the kingdom of heaven on earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"43\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Parents are the central axis around which the universe turns. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"12\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother is the mother for whom Heaven longs and the mother whom the Earth respects. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"18\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Only Begotten Daughter True Mother is working on earth as the True Parents of Heaven, Earth, and Humankind, in complete unity with Heavenly Parent and True Father. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Only Begotten Daughter True Mother is working as the Substantial Holy Spirit. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"15\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother is seeking for people who can love Heaven, love humankind and love the world of creation more than she does. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The Only Begotten Daughter True Mother is looking for the true sons and daughters of Cheon Il Guk who will live in unity with her, one in heart, one in will, one in thought, one in action and one in voice. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"43\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True democracy is forming one family of humankind attending Heavenly Parent. Then all nations become sibling nations in front of Heavenly Parent, and there can be no fighting. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Cheon Il Guk is a nation where humanity can substantially attend and live together with Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"18\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The providential significance of the Cheon Won Gung Cheonil Sanctum Entrance Ceremony is that it marks the beginning of the era in which humanity lives together with Heavenly Parent substantially on earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"35\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Starting from the 13th year of Cheon Il Guk(2025), of the Cheon Won Gung Cheonil Sanctum Entrance Ceremony, we are entering the age when blessed families worldwide will, centered on the Cheon Won Gung Cheonil Sanctum, substantially attend and live together with Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"47\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Heavenly Parent\'s dream is to become one with True Parents and all humankind as God\'s sons and daughters and live together in the kingdom of heaven on earth and in the eternal world. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"34\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In the 13th year of Cheon Il Guk, True Parents have opened a new era in which people can substantially attend and live together with Heavenly Parent. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The chosen people of the Cheon Il Guk Era are the blessed families who are united with True Parents. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"20\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In order to send the Only Begotten Daughter to earth, Heavenly Parent prepared the Han people of Korea as the chosen people over a long period of time. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After 6,000 years of providential history, the Only Begotten Daughter was born on the foundation created by the Korean Han people, within the community of Korean Christianity. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"29\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"After the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter, in order for the Korean people to maintain their position as the chosen people, they must unite with True Parents and take the lead in completing Heaven\'s providence. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"38\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"All the blessed families who have received rebirth and resurrection through True Parents, who are carrying out the providence of salvation for the entire world, have also become the chosen people, regardless of their nationality or ethnic background. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"39\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"As the chosen people, the Korean people and the blessed families have the responsibility to attend True Parents and guide all of humanity to become citizens of Cheon Il Guk. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"33\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Although the Korean people were prepared by Heavenly Parent for the birth of the Only Begotten Daughter, after her birth, merely being of Korean descent does not make one a chosen person. The same is true of the blessed families who have received the grace of rebirth and resurrection from True Parents. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"53\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The blessed families around the world must live as true sons and daughters of Cheon Il Guk, like pure water, without any trace of corruption. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"28\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Those who inherit true love, true life, and true lineage from True Parents, who are one with Heavenly Parent, and who live together with Heavenly Parent are true sons and daughters. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"33\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The true sons and daughters of Cheon Il Guk must become absolutely one with the Only Begotten Daughter True Mother, thinking and acting in unity with her and they must fulfill their responsibility on earth. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"38\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Do you know who the \\\"Holy Mother Han\\\" is? She is the Heavenly Mother who has been hidden for a long time. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"25\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The owner of the universe is Heavenly Mother, who gives birth to life. Nobody can be born without a mother. When you become one with Mother, peace comes to the family, nation, and world. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"37\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"As True Mother guiding us toward victory for the Entrance into the Cheon Won Gung Cheonil Sanctum in the 13th year of Cheon Il Guk, True Mother has opened the era wherein blessed families can attend Heavenly Parent substantially. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"40\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"At the center of this providence of attending Heavenly Parent on earth is Holy Mother Han. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"19\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"To establish the eternal world of peace in the Cheon II Guk era, all people must become one through the love of the mother. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"25\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"This is the age in which we must meet, unite with, and attend Heavenly Mother—who has been hidden until now—through Holy Mother Han, True Mother. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"28\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Holy Mother Han, True Mother, proclaimed Foundation Day and is guiding the settlement of Cheon Il Guk. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"18\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"True Mother has prepared the environment where we can substantially attend Heavenly Parent through the dedication of Cheon Won Gung and also directed the preparations for the Cheonil Sanctum Entrance Ceremony. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"34\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"It is crucial that we unite with the Only Begotten Daughter, True Mother, who is the substantial manifestation of Heavenly Mother. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"24\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"The benefits of the conclusion of the providence must not be limited to the blessed families alone. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"19\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"While Holy Mother Han is here on earth, we must ensure that everybody alive today can attend Holy Mother Han. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"23\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Holy Mother Han, who stands at the center of the completion of the providence, is our True Mother. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"21\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When the true sons and daughters of Cheon Il Guk unite with Holy Mother Han with single-minded determination to realize Heavenly Parent\'s dream, the providence can be completed. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Through Holy Mother Han, we can tangibly experience the warm and embracing love of Heavenly Mother, who nurtures, forgives, and cares for all her sons and daughters. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"30\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"This is a precious moment when we can always long to be with Holy Mother Han while she is on earth and share Heaven\'s heart, shedding tears and laughter together! \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"33\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When we see True Mother, we are seeing Heavenly Mother. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"11\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"When True Mother extends her hand to us, it is Heavenly Mother reaching out to us. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"17\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"In this age, we must live in unity with True Mother, one in heart, one in will, one in thought, one in action and one in voice. \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"28\"\ },\ {\ \"Words\": \"Let us remember True Father\'s earnest request to the blessed families who are living in attendance to Holy Mother Han, the substantial manifestation of Heavenly Mother and the central pillar for the completion of the providence, \\\"Attend True Mother well! Become one with True Mother!\\\" \",\ \"No. of spaces (\<120)\": \"47\"\ }\ ]\}'